    "Cénit %@ · everything is computed on your iPhone · no account · no server": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cénit %@ · everything is computed on your iPhone · no account · no server"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cénit %@ · todo se calcula en tu iPhone · sin cuenta · sin servidor"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cénit Recovery": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cénit Recovery"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recuperación Cénit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cénit computes your recovery, your findings and your levers here, on your iPhone — no cloud, no account, no server.\n\nThe only thing that goes to the internet is «Ask your data», and only if you connect your own AI key.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cénit calcula tu recuperación, tus hallazgos y tus palancas aquí, en tu iPhone, sin nube, sin cuenta, sin servidor.\n\nLo único que sale a internet es «Pregúntale a tus datos», y solo si conectas tu propia clave de IA."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cénit is free and always will be, nothing is locked. It cost real money and a lot of unpaid hours to build, and there's a Windows app and an iOS app I want to ship next. If it's useful to you and you want to help with the development and testing costs, even a few quid in crypto genuinely keeps it moving, and honestly it keeps me motivated to keep building.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cénit is free and always will be, nothing is locked. It cost real money and a lot of unpaid hours to build, and there's a Windows app and an iOS app I want to ship next. If it's useful to you and you want to help with the development and testing costs, even a few quid in crypto genuinely keeps it moving, and honestly it keeps me motivated to keep building."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cénit es gratis y siempre lo será; nada está bloqueado. Construirlo costó dinero real y muchas horas no pagadas, y quiero lanzar próximamente una app para Windows y otra para iOS. Si te resulta útil y quieres ayudar con los costos de desarrollo y pruebas, incluso unos cuantos pesos en cripto de verdad lo mantienen avanzando y, honestamente, me motivan a seguir construyendo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cénit is not a medical device. It is for informational and personal-insight purposes only and is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any condition. Talk to a clinician for medical advice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cénit is not a medical device. It is for informational and personal-insight purposes only and is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any condition. Talk to a clinician for medical advice."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cénit no es un dispositivo médico. Es solo para fines informativos y de conocimiento personal, y no está destinado a diagnosticar, tratar, curar ni prevenir ninguna condición. Consulta a un médico para recibir consejo médico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cénit pairs directly with your WHOOP over Bluetooth — no WHOOP app, no cloud.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cénit pairs directly with your WHOOP over Bluetooth — no WHOOP app, no cloud."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cénit se empareja directamente con tu banda por Bluetooth, sin la app de WHOOP, sin nube."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cénit reads your recovery, sleep and strain and keeps them only on your iPhone. No account, no servers. Give it a few days of data and you'll start to see your patterns.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cénit reads your recovery, sleep and strain and keeps them only on your iPhone. No account, no servers. Give it a few days of data and you'll start to see your patterns."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cénit lee tu recuperación, sueño y esfuerzo y los guarda solo en tu iPhone. Sin cuenta, sin servidores. Dale unos días de datos y empezarás a ver tus patrones."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cénit reads your sleep, steps, workouts, weight and heart rate from Apple Health to give you an honest read of your body.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cénit reads your sleep, steps, workouts, weight and heart rate from Apple Health to give you an honest read of your body."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cénit lee tu sueño, pasos, entrenamientos, peso y frecuencia cardiaca desde Apple Salud para darte una lectura honesta de tu cuerpo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cénit scores your recovery, strain and sleep itself — on-device, no cloud.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
