    "Each cell is a day · greener = higher adherence. Tap a day to view it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each cell is a day · greener = higher adherence. Tap a day to view it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada celda es un día · más verde = más apego. Toca un día para verlo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each night your strap averages the oxygen saturation read at your wrist while you sleep. A healthy adult typically sits at 95–100%; readings below 90% are considered low (hypoxemia). Isolated low nights are usually noise — altitude, a cold, or how the sensor sat. A sustained run of low nights is what's worth a look with a finger pulse oximeter.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each night your strap averages the oxygen saturation read at your wrist while you sleep. A healthy adult typically sits at 95–100%; readings below 90% are considered low (hypoxemia). Isolated low nights are usually noise — altitude, a cold, or how the sensor sat. A sustained run of low nights is what's worth a look with a finger pulse oximeter."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada noche tu banda promedia la saturación de oxígeno medida en tu muñeca mientras duermes. Un adulto sano suele estar en 95–100%; lecturas por debajo de 90% se consideran bajas (hipoxemia). Las noches bajas aisladas suelen ser ruido, altitud, un resfriado, o cómo quedó el sensor. Una racha sostenida de noches bajas es lo que amerita revisarse con un oxímetro de dedo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each night's deviation · the band is your typical swing (±your variation) · 0 is your baseline.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each night's deviation · the band is your typical swing (±your variation) · 0 is your baseline."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Desviación de cada noche · la banda es tu vaivén típico (±tu variación) · 0 es tu base."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each point is one night's deviation from your baseline. The shaded band is your own typical night-to-night swing (±1 SD around 0) — inside it is business as usual; a run of nights poking out the same side is the signal. Average and the range come from the period you pick; the chip compares this month's average with last month's, in °C.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each point is one night's deviation from your baseline. The shaded band is your own typical night-to-night swing (±1 SD around 0) — inside it is business as usual; a run of nights poking out the same side is the signal. Average and the range come from the period you pick; the chip compares this month's average with last month's, in °C."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada punto es la desviación de una noche respecto a tu base. La banda sombreada es tu propio vaivén típico de noche a noche (±1 DE alrededor de 0), dentro de ella es lo normal; varias noches seguidas saliéndose por el mismo lado son la señal. El promedio y el rango salen del periodo que elijas; el chip compara el promedio de este mes con el del mes pasado, en °C."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each point is one night. The recommended zone for an adult is 7–9 h.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each point is one night. The recommended zone for an adult is 7–9 h."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada punto es una noche. La zona recomendada para un adulto es de 7 a 9 h."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each point is your daily stress index. The bands behind it are the fixed Low / Moderate / High zones (0–1 / 1–2 / 2–3). The percentage compares this month's average with last month's; Average, Lowest and Highest come from the range you selected. What matters isn't a single day — it's several days in a row drifting into a higher band.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each point is your daily stress index. The bands behind it are the fixed Low / Moderate / High zones (0–1 / 1–2 / 2–3). The percentage compares this month's average with last month's; Average, Lowest and Highest come from the range you selected. What matters isn't a single day — it's several days in a row drifting into a higher band."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada punto es tu índice de estrés diario. Las bandas detrás son las zonas fijas Bajo / Moderado / Alto (0–1 / 1–2 / 2–3). El porcentaje compara el promedio de este mes con el del mes pasado; Promedio, Mínimo y Máximo salen del rango que seleccionaste. Lo que importa no es un día suelto, son varios días seguidos subiendo de banda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each point is your daily stress index. The bands behind it are the fixed Low / Moderate / High zones (0–1 / 1–2 / 2–3). The percentage compares this period's average with the previous period of the same length; Average, Lowest and Highest come from the range you selected. What matters isn't a single day — it's several days in a row drifting into a higher band.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each point is your daily stress index. The bands behind it are the fixed Low / Moderate / High zones (0–1 / 1–2 / 2–3). The percentage compares this period's average with the previous period of the same length; Average, Lowest and Highest come from the range you selected. What matters isn't a single day — it's several days in a row drifting into a higher band."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada punto es tu índice de estrés diario. Las bandas detrás son las zonas fijas Bajo / Moderado / Alto (0–1 / 1–2 / 2–3). El porcentaje compara el promedio de este periodo con el del periodo anterior del mismo largo; Promedio, Más bajo y Más alto salen del rango que seleccionaste. Lo que importa no es un solo día, sino varios días seguidos derivando a una banda más alta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each second of heart rate is mapped to one of five intensity zones; time in the higher zones counts for much more. The weighted total is compressed onto a 0–21 scale through a logarithmic curve, so the top of the scale represents a theoretical full day at peak intensity.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each second of heart rate is mapped to one of five intensity zones; time in the higher zones counts for much more. The weighted total is compressed onto a 0–21 scale through a logarithmic curve, so the top of the scale represents a theoretical full day at peak intensity."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada segundo de frecuencia cardiaca se asigna a una de cinco zonas de intensidad; el tiempo en las zonas altas cuenta mucho más. El total ponderado se comprime a una escala de 0 a 21 con una curva logarítmica, así que el tope representa un día entero teórico a intensidad máxima."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each set adds load to the muscles it works, decaying by half every two days — the time course of muscle protein synthesis (MacDougall 1995). Color is relative to your most-loaded muscle, so it reads which of your muscles are hot right now. Weekly volume is judged against a 10–20 sets-per-muscle band (Schoenfeld 2017). The recommendation crosses this with your strap recovery: a low-recovery day gates everything to rest.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada serie suma carga a los músculos que trabaja y decae a la mitad cada dos días, el curso de la síntesis de proteína muscular (MacDougall 1995). El color es relativo a tu músculo más cargado, así que lees cuáles de tus músculos están calientes ahora. El volumen semanal se compara con una banda de 10–20 series por músculo (Schoenfeld 2017). La recomendación lo cruza con la recuperación de tu banda: un día de baja recuperación lo manda todo a descansar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each set adds load to the muscles it works, decaying by half every two days: the time course of muscle protein synthesis (MacDougall 1995; Damas 2015). Color is relative to your most-loaded muscle, so it reads which of your muscles are hot right now. Weekly volume is judged against the 10–20 sets-per-week band (Schoenfeld 2017), a hypertrophy guide per muscle group; the volume shown is weighted by involvement, so secondary muscles count less. The recommendation crosses this with your strap recovery: a low-recovery day gates everything to rest.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each set adds load to the muscles it works, decaying by half every two days: the time course of muscle protein synthesis (MacDougall 1995; Damas 2015). Color is relative to your most-loaded muscle, so it reads which of your muscles are hot right now. Weekly volume is judged against the 10–20 sets-per-week band (Schoenfeld 2017), a hypertrophy guide per muscle group; the volume shown is weighted by involvement, so secondary muscles count less. The recommendation crosses this with your strap recovery: a low-recovery day gates everything to rest."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada serie suma carga a los músculos que trabaja y decae a la mitad cada dos días: el curso temporal de la síntesis de proteína muscular (MacDougall 1995; Damas 2015). El color es relativo a tu músculo más cargado, así que lee cuáles de tus músculos están calientes ahora. El volumen semanal se juzga contra la banda de 10–20 series por semana (Schoenfeld 2017), una guía de hipertrofia por grupo muscular; el volumen mostrado está ponderado por involucramiento, así que los músculos secundarios cuentan menos. La recomendación lo cruza con la recuperación de tu banda: un día de recuperación baja lo manda todo a descanso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each set loads the muscles it works and fades by half every 2 days · ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each set loads the muscles it works and fades by half every 2 days · "
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada serie carga los músculos que trabaja y decae a la mitad cada 2 días · "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each signal becomes a score of how far above or below your personal average it sits (a z-score). They're combined with the weights above and mapped onto a 0–100 scale through a logistic curve, calibrated so a typical day lands near 58. It's an estimate, not a diagnosis.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each signal becomes a score of how far above or below your personal average it sits (a z-score). They're combined with the weights above and mapped onto a 0–100 scale through a logistic curve, calibrated so a typical day lands near 58. It's an estimate, not a diagnosis."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada señal se vuelve una puntuación de qué tan por encima o por debajo de tu promedio personal está (un z-score). Se combinan con los pesos de arriba y se mapean a una escala de 0–100 con una curva logística, calibrada para que un día típico caiga cerca de 58. Es una estimación, no un diagnóstico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each signal becomes a score of how far above or below your personal average it sits (a z-score, in σ). They're combined with the weights shown and mapped onto a 0–100 scale through a logistic curve, calibrated so a typical day lands near 58. It's an estimate, not a diagnosis.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each signal becomes a score of how far above or below your personal average it sits (a z-score, in σ). They're combined with the weights shown and mapped onto a 0–100 scale through a logistic curve, calibrated so a typical day lands near 58. It's an estimate, not a diagnosis."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada señal se convierte en una medida de qué tan por encima o por debajo de tu promedio personal está (un z-score, en σ). Se combinan con los pesos mostrados y se llevan a una escala de 0 a 100 con una curva logística, calibrada para que un día típico caiga cerca de 58. Es una estimación, no un diagnóstico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each signal becomes a score of how far above or below your personal average it sits; they're averaged with the weights above and mapped onto a 0–100 scale, calibrated so a typical day lands near 58.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each signal becomes a score of how far above or below your personal average it sits; they're averaged with the weights above and mapped onto a 0–100 scale, calibrated so a typical day lands near 58."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada señal se vuelve un puntaje de qué tan arriba o abajo está de tu promedio personal; se promedian con los pesos de arriba y se ajustan a una escala 0–100, calibrada para que un día típico caiga cerca de 58."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each square is a day, tinted by your recovery — red when low, amber in the middle, green when high. Empty squares are days with no reading. It's the at-a-glance shape of your last three months. (Buchheit 2014)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each square is a day, tinted by your recovery — red when low, amber in the middle, green when high. Empty squares are days with no reading. It's the at-a-glance shape of your last three months. (Buchheit 2014)"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada cuadro es un día, tintado por tu recuperación, rojo cuando es baja, ámbar en medio, verde cuando es alta. Los cuadros vacíos son días sin lectura. Es la forma de un vistazo de tus últimos tres meses. (Buchheit 2014)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each square is a day, tinted by your recovery; empty squares are days with no reading.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each square is a day, tinted by your recovery; empty squares are days with no reading."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada cuadro es un día, tintado por tu recuperación; los cuadros vacíos son días sin lectura."
          }
        }
      }
    },
