        }
      }
    },
    "How alike your mid-sleep point is night to night — it predicts your health better than total hours.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How alike your mid-sleep point is night to night — it predicts your health better than total hours."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qué tan parecido es tu punto medio de sueño noche a noche, predice tu salud mejor que las horas totales."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How alike your nights are to one another. \"Steady\" means they resemble each other. When HRV starts jumping from night to night — even while the average still looks high — it tends to get ahead of fatigue, before the number drops.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How alike your nights are to one another. \"Steady\" means they resemble each other. When HRV starts jumping from night to night — even while the average still looks high — it tends to get ahead of fatigue, before the number drops."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qué tan parecidas son tus noches entre sí. «Estable» significa que se parecen unas a otras. Cuando tu HRV empieza a saltar de una noche a otra, aunque el promedio siga alto, suele adelantarse a la fatiga, antes de que el número baje."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How each habit moves a metric, across your whole history. Associations, not cause.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cómo cada hábito mueve una métrica, en todo tu historial. Asociaciones, no causa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How each habit moves you, across your whole history": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cómo cada hábito te mueve, en todo tu historial"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How even it stays from one week to the next. Steadier usually means better rest; very uneven can be fatigue.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How even it stays from one week to the next. Steadier usually means better rest; very uneven can be fatigue."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qué tan pareja está de una semana a otra. Más pareja suele ser mejor descanso; muy dispareja puede ser fatiga."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How it's calculated": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How it's calculated"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cómo se calcula"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long it took you to fall asleep after lights out. Ten to twenty minutes is a healthy range.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How long it took you to fall asleep after lights out. Ten to twenty minutes is a healthy range."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuánto tardaste en quedarte dormido tras apagar la luz. De diez a veinte minutos es un rango saludable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many breaths you take per minute while you sleep. It's one of the steadiest signals your body has, so even a small rise from your own normal can be an early sign of strain, illness, or a late, heavy meal.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How many breaths you take per minute while you sleep. It's one of the steadiest signals your body has, so even a small rise from your own normal can be an early sign of strain, illness, or a late, heavy meal."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuántas respiraciones tomas por minuto mientras duermes. Es una de las señales más estables de tu cuerpo, así que incluso una subida pequeña respecto a tu normal puede ser un aviso temprano de carga, de que algo viene, o de una cena pesada y tardía."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the last month sat in the Low band (calm time — higher is better), and how steady your daily stress is week to week (its coefficient of variation, CV — low = steady). The Low / Moderate / High bands (0–1 / 1–2 / 2–3) are the same for everyone because the index is already adjusted to your own baseline; they're drawn as the trend's legend below. (Plews 2013)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How much of the last month sat in the Low band (calm time — higher is better), and how steady your daily stress is week to week (its coefficient of variation, CV — low = steady). The Low / Moderate / High bands (0–1 / 1–2 / 2–3) are the same for everyone because the index is already adjusted to your own baseline; they're drawn as the trend's legend below. (Plews 2013)"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuánto del último mes estuvo en la banda Baja (tiempo en calma, más es mejor), y qué tan constante es tu estrés diario semana a semana (su coeficiente de variación, CV, bajo = constante). Las bandas Baja / Moderada / Alta (0–1 / 1–2 / 2–3) son iguales para todos porque el índice ya está ajustado a tu propia línea base; se dibujan como la leyenda de la tendencia, abajo. (Plews 2013)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the last month you spent with low autonomic load.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How much of the last month you spent with low autonomic load."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuánto del último mes pasaste con carga autonómica baja."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much you slept versus what your body needs. At 100% you fully covered last night's need.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How much you slept versus what your body needs. At 100% you fully covered last night's need."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuánto dormiste frente a lo que tu cuerpo necesita. Al 100% cubriste por completo lo que necesitabas anoche."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much your nightly temperature swings around your baseline. Lower is steadier.": {
