            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aún no encuentro un hábito con efecto claro en tus números. Sigue registrando tu día y lo detectaré."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I haven't found clear links yet. They'll show up here as soon as I see them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Todavía no encuentro vínculos claros. Aparecerán aquí en cuanto los vea."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I keep this project anonymous, so crypto is the only way to chip in — no Patreon, no PayPal, no name attached. Quick, global, and private for both of us.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I keep this project anonymous, so crypto is the only way to chip in — no Patreon, no PayPal, no name attached. Quick, global, and private for both of us."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mantengo este proyecto anónimo, así que las cripto son la única forma de cooperar, sin Patreon, sin PayPal, sin nombres. Rápido, global y privado para ambos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I need about two weeks of data to reveal your first pattern with confidence.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Necesito unas dos semanas de datos para revelarte tu primer patrón con confianza."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I need at least 3 signals to work this out without guessing. You have %lld.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I need at least 3 signals to work this out without guessing. You have %lld."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Necesito al menos 3 señales para calcularla sin adivinar. Llevas %lld."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I need several weeks of nights with your band on to read the rhythm of your temperature. Still watching.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Necesito varias semanas de noches con tu banda puesta para leer el ritmo de tu temperatura. Sigo observando."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I spotted a hunch in your data. Try it 7 nights and I'll tell you if it's real for you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vi una corazonada en tus datos. Pruébalo 7 noches y te digo si es real para ti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I understand this is a rough estimate to know myself better, not a contraceptive method or a medical tool.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entiendo que es una estimación aproximada para conocerme mejor, no un método anticonceptivo ni una herramienta médica."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'll stop estimating your phase. Your temperature data and everything else stay the same.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dejo de estimar tu fase. Tus datos de temperatura y todo lo demás se quedan igual."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm learning your pattern.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estoy aprendiendo tu patrón."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm still gathering signal from your nights. Ask me anything, or sync your strap for more precise reads.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'm still gathering signal from your nights. Ask me anything, or sync your strap for more precise reads."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aún reúno señal de tus noches. Pregúntame lo que quieras, o sincroniza tu banda para lecturas más precisas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm still learning how your body works.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aún estoy aprendiendo cómo funciona tu cuerpo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm still learning your rhythm. A few more nights and the read sharpens.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'm still learning your rhythm. A few more nights and the read sharpens."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aún estoy aprendiendo tu ritmo. Unas cuantas noches más y la lectura se afina."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm still learning your schedule: %lld more nights and I'll know how regular your mid-sleep point is — the figure that predicts your health better than hours.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'm still learning your schedule: %lld more nights and I'll know how regular your mid-sleep point is — the figure that predicts your health better than hours."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aún estoy aprendiendo tu horario: con %lld noches más sabré qué tan regular es tu punto medio de sueño, el dato que predice tu salud mejor que las horas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm still reviewing your nights. Log your days so I find what moves you sooner.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
