    "Isolated low nights are usually noise (altitude, a cold, sensor fit). A sustained run is worth a look with a finger pulse oximeter.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Isolated low nights are usually noise (altitude, a cold, sensor fit). A sustained run is worth a look with a finger pulse oximeter."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las noches bajas aisladas suelen ser ruido (altitud, un resfriado, cómo quedó el sensor). Una racha sostenida amerita revisarla con un oxímetro de dedo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It didn't coincide with any of your events.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
