          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It sits on top of Apple Health and sharpens the signal: continuous HRV and strap-grade recovery.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It sits on top of Apple Health and sharpens the signal: continuous HRV and strap-grade recovery."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se monta sobre Apple Salud y afina la señal: HRV continuo y recuperación de grado banda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It will stop streaming until you re-scan. Your saved data isn't touched.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It will stop streaming until you re-scan. Your saved data isn't touched."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dejará de transmitir hasta que vuelvas a escanear. Tus datos guardados no se tocan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's a comparison of your fitness, not your biological age or a medical diagnosis.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's a comparison of your fitness, not your biological age or a medical diagnosis."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es una comparación de tu condición física, no tu edad biológica ni un diagnóstico médico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's a strong association in your data, but not proof of cause. An experiment can promote it to «proven».": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es una asociación fuerte en tus datos, pero no prueba causa. Un experimento puede ascenderla a «probada»."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's an association, not a cause. Things like training on the days you already wake up well (then drifting back down), resting when you're tired or sick, or which day of the week you train all play a part.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's an association, not a cause. Things like training on the days you already wake up well (then drifting back down), resting when you're tired or sick, or which day of the week you train all play a part."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es una asociación, no una causa. Influyen cosas como entrenar justo los días que amaneces bien (y luego «bajar» de forma natural), descansar cuando estás cansado o enfermo, o el día de la semana en que sueles entrenar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's an estimate from your own history, not a diagnosis.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's an estimate from your own history, not a diagnosis."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es una estimación a partir de tu propio historial, no un diagnóstico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's an estimate, not a diagnosis.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's an estimate, not a diagnosis."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es una estimación, no un diagnóstico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's coincidence, not cause.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's coincidence, not cause."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es coincidencia, no causa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's context for your recovery, not an injury prediction.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's context for your recovery, not an injury prediction."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es contexto para tu recuperación, no una predicción de lesión."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's copied into «My routines». You can edit it like any routine.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's copied into «My routines». You can edit it like any routine."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se copia a «Mis rutinas». Podrás editarla como cualquier rutina."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's not a diagnosis.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's not a diagnosis."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No es un diagnóstico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's not an ECG.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's not an ECG."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No es un ECG."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's the average of your heart rate variability over the last week. Higher usually goes hand in hand with better recovery.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's the average of your heart rate variability over the last week. Higher usually goes hand in hand with better recovery."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es el promedio de tu variabilidad cardiaca de la última semana. Más alta suele ir de la mano con mejor recuperación."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's the average oxygen saturation read at your wrist while you sleep, over the last week. A healthy adult usually stays at 95% or above.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's the average oxygen saturation read at your wrist while you sleep, over the last week. A healthy adult usually stays at 95% or above."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es el promedio de la saturación de oxígeno medida en tu muñeca mientras duermes, en la última semana. Un adulto sano suele mantenerse en 95% o más."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's the base of your data in Cénit.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's the base of your data in Cénit."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es la base de tus datos en Cénit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's within a metre of your iPhone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's within a metre of your iPhone."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Está a menos de un metro de tu iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's your average breathing rate while you sleep. It's usually very steady; if it rises above your normal, it can be an early sign that something is taxing you.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's your average breathing rate while you sleep. It's usually very steady; if it rises above your normal, it can be an early sign that something is taxing you."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es tu ritmo de respiración promedio mientras duermes. Suele ser muy estable; si sube sobre tu normal, puede ser señal temprana de que algo te está exigiendo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's your lowest heart rate while you sleep. Lower usually points to better fitness and rest.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's your lowest heart rate while you sleep. Lower usually points to better fitness and rest."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es tu frecuencia cardiaca más baja mientras duermes. Más baja suele indicar mejor forma y descanso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
