    "The line includes today, still in progress; the figures below use completed days only.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The line includes today, still in progress; the figures below use completed days only."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La línea incluye hoy, aún en curso; las cifras de abajo usan solo días completos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The line is your 7-day moving average over the period you pick. The percentage compares this month's average with last month's. Average, Lowest and Highest come from the range you selected.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The line is your 7-day moving average over the period you pick. The percentage compares this month's average with last month's. Average, Lowest and Highest come from the range you selected."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La línea es tu promedio móvil de 7 días en el periodo que elijas. El porcentaje compara el promedio de este mes con el del mes pasado. Promedio, Mínimo y Máximo salen del rango que seleccionaste."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The line is your 7-day moving average over the period you pick. The percentage compares this month's average with last month's. Average, Median, Lowest, Highest and σ (how spread out your days are) come from the range you selected.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The line is your 7-day moving average over the period you pick. The percentage compares this month's average with last month's. Average, Median, Lowest, Highest and σ (how spread out your days are) come from the range you selected."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La línea es tu promedio móvil de 7 días en el periodo que elijas. El porcentaje compara el promedio de este mes con el del mes pasado. Promedio, mediana, mínimo, máximo y σ (qué tan dispersos están tus días) salen del rango que seleccionaste."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The line is your 7-day moving average over the period you pick. The percentage compares this month's average with last month's. The average and range come from the range you selected.": {
