          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model is getting ready": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model is getting ready"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El modelo se está preparando"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The monitor beats in real time when your WHOOP is nearby and worn.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The monitor beats in real time when your WHOOP is nearby and worn."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El monitor late en tiempo real cuando tu banda está cerca y puesta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The more I know about your habits, the more patterns I find": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entre más sé de tus hábitos, más patrones encuentro"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The more nights you sleep with the band, the sooner I see it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entre más noches duermas con la banda, antes lo veo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The more you log, the more patterns I find": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuanto más anotas, más patrones encuentro"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The oxygen in your blood, read at your wrist while you sleep. A healthy adult usually stays at 95% or above.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The oxygen in your blood, read at your wrist while you sleep. A healthy adult usually stays at 95% or above."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El oxígeno en tu sangre, medido en la muñeca mientras duermes. Un adulto sano suele mantenerse en 95% o más."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The phase is estimated from the temperature your band measures while you sleep. When you sync nights with the band again, I'll pick the reading back up.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La fase se estima con la temperatura que tu banda mide mientras duermes. Cuando vuelvas a sincronizar noches con la banda, retomo la lectura."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The plan": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The plan"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El plan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The provider is rate-limiting requests right now. Wait a moment and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The provider is rate-limiting requests right now. Wait a moment and try again."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El proveedor está limitando las solicitudes ahora mismo. Espera un momento e inténtalo de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The provider returned an error (%lld)%@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The provider returned an error (%lld)%@."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El proveedor devolvió un error (%lld)%@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The reading is approximate and always comes with a «probably». Temperature confirms the phase one to three days after it changes, so this looks backward, not at this moment.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La lectura es aproximada y siempre va con un «probablemente». La temperatura confirma la fase uno a tres días después de que cambia, así que esto mira hacia atrás, no en el momento."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rest can wait.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The rest can wait."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo demás puede esperar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The routine builder — pick exercises, set your work sets, and save reusable routines or start from a template — arrives in a coming update.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The routine builder — pick exercises, set your work sets, and save reusable routines or start from a template — arrives in a coming update."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El creador de rutinas, elige ejercicios, define tus series de trabajo y guarda rutinas reutilizables o empieza desde una plantilla, llega en una próxima actualización."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same measure, 0–100:": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The same measure, 0–100:"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La misma medida, 0–100:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The share of your recent days that sat in the Low band (under 1.0). Higher is better — it means your body had room to recover. It's a count of days, not a measure of how low any single day went.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The share of your recent days that sat in the Low band (under 1.0). Higher is better — it means your body had room to recover. It's a count of days, not a measure of how low any single day went."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La proporción de tus días recientes que cayeron en la banda Baja (menos de 1.0). Más alto es mejor, significa que tu cuerpo tuvo margen para recuperarse. Es un conteo de días, no una medida de qué tan bajo llegó un día en particular."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The slope is how much it rises or falls on average per day, by linear regression over the period. The percentage compares this period's average against the previous period of the same length. Average, Lowest and Highest are from the range you selected.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The slope is how much it rises or falls on average per day, by linear regression over the period. The percentage compares this period's average against the previous period of the same length. Average, Lowest and Highest are from the range you selected."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La pendiente es cuánto sube o baja en promedio por día, por regresión lineal sobre el periodo. El porcentaje compara el promedio de este periodo contra el del periodo anterior del mismo largo. Promedio, Más bajo y Más alto son del rango que seleccionaste."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The slope is how much it rises or falls on average per day, by linear regression over the period. The percentage vs last month compares this month's average against the previous one. Average, Lowest and Highest are from the range you selected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The slope is how much it rises or falls on average per day, by linear regression over the period. The percentage vs last month compares this month's average against the previous one. Average, Lowest and Highest are from the range you selected."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La pendiente es cuánto sube o baja en promedio por día, por regresión lineal sobre el periodo. El porcentaje vs el mes pasado compara el promedio de este mes contra el anterior. Promedio, Más bajo y Más alto son del periodo que elegiste."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sooner you log, the sooner I find patterns": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entre antes anotes, antes encuentro patrones"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The strength sessions you've finished.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The strength sessions you've finished."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las sesiones de fuerza que has terminado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The thread of you over time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The thread of you over time."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El hilo de ti a través del tiempo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The window": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La ventana"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The work weight is light. No warm-up needed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El peso de trabajo es ligero. No necesitas calentamiento."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The «vs your base» bars show each signal's deviation in σ (above your base = right). HRV, resting heart rate and respiration are z-scored that way; sleep and skin temperature carry no σ, so they show their state, not a position. Your normal range is your recent average ± one σ. Steadiness is the coefficient of variation (CV). Training load is the acute:chronic workload ratio (ACWR) — context for recovery, never an injury claim.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The «vs your base» bars show each signal's deviation in σ (above your base = right). HRV, resting heart rate and respiration are z-scored that way; sleep and skin temperature carry no σ, so they show their state, not a position. Your normal range is your recent average ± one σ. Steadiness is the coefficient of variation (CV). Training load is the acute:chronic workload ratio (ACWR) — context for recovery, never an injury claim."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las barras «vs tu base» muestran la desviación de cada señal en σ (por encima de tu base = derecha). La VFC, la frecuencia cardiaca en reposo y la respiración se miden así (z-score); el sueño y la temperatura de la piel no tienen σ, así que muestran su estado, no una posición. Tu rango normal es tu promedio reciente ± una σ. La estabilidad es el coeficiente de variación (CV). La carga de entrenamiento es la razón aguda:crónica (ACWR), contexto para la recuperación, nunca una afirmación de lesión."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then re-nudge every": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Luego repetir cada"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There are no calendars on this iPhone yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There are no calendars on this iPhone yet."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aún no hay calendarios en este iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There isn't enough data for a read today yet. Sync your strap and come back in a few days.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There isn't enough data for a read today yet. Sync your strap and come back in a few days."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aún no hay datos suficientes para una lectura de hoy. Sincroniza tu banda y vuelve en unos días."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There was too much movement or too little signal at rest. It's normal, try again tomorrow.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There was too much movement or too little signal at rest. It's normal, try again tomorrow."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hubo mucho movimiento o poca señal en reposo. Es normal, vuelve a intentar mañana."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These aren't in your library. Match each one to an exercise you have, or create it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These aren't in your library. Match each one to an exercise you have, or create it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estos no están en tu biblioteca. Empareja cada uno con un ejercicio que tengas, o créalo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These bands are the same for everyone because the index is already adjusted to your own baseline, not to the population — a 1.5 sits at YOUR normal. So there's no personal ± range to compute: what's worth watching is drifting into «High» for several days in a row.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These bands are the same for everyone because the index is already adjusted to your own baseline, not to the population — a 1.5 sits at YOUR normal. So there's no personal ± range to compute: what's worth watching is drifting into «High» for several days in a row."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estas bandas son iguales para todos porque el índice ya viene ajustado a tu propia base, no a la población, un 1.5 cae en TU normal. Por eso no hay un rango personal ± que calcular: lo que vale la pena vigilar es pasar a «Alto» varios días seguidos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These days you've trained less than your body is used to.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These days you've trained less than your body is used to."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estos días has entrenado menos de lo que tu cuerpo acostumbra."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These days you've trained more than your body is used to.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These days you've trained more than your body is used to."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estos días has entrenado más de lo que tu cuerpo acostumbra."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These power your heart-rate zones, calorie estimates and recovery baselines. Keep them accurate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These power your heart-rate zones, calorie estimates and recovery baselines. Keep them accurate."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estos datos alimentan tus zonas de frecuencia cardiaca, las estimaciones de calorías y tus líneas base de recuperación. Mantenlos precisos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They're in «My routines», ready to train.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
