    "The 10–20 band is a hypertrophy guide per muscle group (Schoenfeld 2017); the number shown is sets weighted by involvement, so secondary muscles count less.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The 10–20 band is a hypertrophy guide per muscle group (Schoenfeld 2017); the number shown is sets weighted by involvement, so secondary muscles count less."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La banda 10–20 es una guía de hipertrofia por grupo muscular (Schoenfeld 2017); el número mostrado son series ponderadas por involucramiento, así que los músculos secundarios cuentan menos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
