          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El idioma del plan no es compatible, debe ser español o inglés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make the strap do things: tap to act, train by feel, wake to a buzz.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Make the strap do things: tap to act, train by feel, wake to a buzz."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Haz que la banda haga cosas, toca para actuar, entrena por sensación, despierta con un zumbido."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run a Shortcut when the strap comes off or goes back on: set a Focus, pause media, mark yourself away.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Run a Shortcut when the strap comes off or goes back on: set a Focus, pause media, mark yourself away."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ejecuta un atajo cuando te quitas o te pones la banda, activa un modo de Concentración, pausa el audio, márcate ausente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Presence automation: set a Focus, pause media, set away…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence automation: set a Focus, pause media, set away…"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatización de presencia, activa un modo de Concentración, pausa el audio, márcate ausente…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Train by feel: the strap buzzes so you don't have to watch a screen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Train by feel: the strap buzzes so you don't have to watch a screen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entrena por sensación, la banda zumba para que no tengas que mirar una pantalla."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A gentle buzz when your HRV drops while your heart rate is calm: a cue to take a paced breath. Rate-limited to once every 15 minutes; off by default.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A gentle buzz when your HRV drops while your heart rate is calm: a cue to take a paced breath. Rate-limited to once every 15 minutes; off by default."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un zumbido suave cuando tu HRV baja mientras tu pulso está en calma, una señal para respirar con calma. Limitado a una vez cada 15 minutos; apagado por defecto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watches your resting HR, HRV, skin temperature and respiration against your own 28-day baseline. On-device and approximate: informational only, not a diagnosis.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Watches your resting HR, HRV, skin temperature and respiration against your own 28-day baseline. On-device and approximate: informational only, not a diagnosis."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vigila tu FC en reposo, HRV, temperatura de la piel y respiración contra tu propia base de 28 días. En el dispositivo y aproximado, solo informativo, no un diagnóstico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needs at least 14 days of history. When two or more signals drift together you get a notification: at most once a day.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Needs at least 14 days of history. When two or more signals drift together you get a notification: at most once a day."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Necesita al menos 14 días de historial. Cuando dos o más señales se desvían juntas, recibes una notificación, máximo una vez al día."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your data is always stored the same way: this only changes how distances, weights, heights and temperatures are shown.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your data is always stored the same way: this only changes how distances, weights, heights and temperatures are shown."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tus datos siempre se guardan igual; esto solo cambia cómo se muestran distancias, pesos, estaturas y temperaturas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pairs directly with your strap over Bluetooth: no WHOOP app, no cloud.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pairs directly with your strap over Bluetooth: no WHOOP app, no cloud."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se vincula directo con tu banda por Bluetooth, sin app de WHOOP, sin nube."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sync the last few weeks two-way, on-device: Cénit reads your Apple Health HR, HRV, sleep, SpO₂ and steps, and writes its own strap-derived metrics back. Strictly opt-in: nothing leaves your iPhone. (For a one-time bulk history, use the export import above.)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sync the last few weeks two-way, on-device: Cénit reads your Apple Health HR, HRV, sleep, SpO₂ and steps, and writes its own strap-derived metrics back. Strictly opt-in: nothing leaves your iPhone. (For a one-time bulk history, use the export import above.)"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sincroniza las últimas semanas en ambos sentidos, en el dispositivo: Cénit lee tu FC, HRV, sueño, SpO₂ y pasos de Apple Health, y escribe de vuelta sus propias métricas derivadas de la banda. Estrictamente opcional, nada sale de tu iPhone. (Para un historial masivo de una vez, usa la importación de exportación de arriba.)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steps, heart, sleep, body composition and VO₂ max: read locally on this iPhone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steps, heart, sleep, body composition and VO₂ max: read locally on this iPhone."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pasos, corazón, sueño, composición corporal y VO₂ máx, leídos localmente en este iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Association, not cause: moving together isn't one driving the other.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Association, not cause: moving together isn't one driving the other."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Asociación, no causa, moverse juntas no es que una empuje a la otra."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Association, not cause: these move together, neither drives the other.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Association, not cause: these move together, neither drives the other."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Asociación, no causa, se mueven juntas, ninguna empuja a la otra."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each point is one night's deviation from your baseline. The shaded band is your own typical night-to-night swing (±1 SD around 0): inside it is business as usual; a run of nights poking out the same side is the signal. Average and the range come from the period you pick; the chip compares this period's average with the previous period of the same length, in °C.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each point is one night's deviation from your baseline. The shaded band is your own typical night-to-night swing (±1 SD around 0): inside it is business as usual; a run of nights poking out the same side is the signal. Average and the range come from the period you pick; the chip compares this period's average with the previous period of the same length, in °C."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada punto es la desviación de una noche respecto a tu base. La banda sombreada es tu propio vaivén típico de noche a noche (±1 DE alrededor de 0), dentro de ella es lo normal; varias noches seguidas saliéndose por el mismo lado son la señal. El promedio y el rango salen del periodo que elijas; el chip compara el promedio de este periodo con el del periodo anterior del mismo largo, en °C."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far last night's skin temperature ran from your own recent baseline, in °C. We learn your normal over recent nights, so 0 is your usual and the number is the shift up or down. A single warm or cool night rarely means much: what's worth noticing is several nights in a row drifting the same way. It's a comfort signal, not a thermometer or a diagnosis.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How far last night's skin temperature ran from your own recent baseline, in °C. We learn your normal over recent nights, so 0 is your usual and the number is the shift up or down. A single warm or cool night rarely means much: what's worth noticing is several nights in a row drifting the same way. It's a comfort signal, not a thermometer or a diagnosis."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qué tanto se alejó la temperatura de tu piel anoche de tu propia base reciente, en °C. Aprendemos tu normal de las últimas noches, así que 0 es lo de siempre y el número es cuánto subió o bajó. Una sola noche cálida o fría rara vez significa algo, lo que vale la pena notar son varias noches seguidas moviéndose hacia el mismo lado. Es una señal de confort, no un termómetro ni un diagnóstico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The standard deviation of your nightly deviations: how much your skin temperature wanders around your baseline from night to night, in °C. A small number means steady thermoregulation; a larger one means more night-to-night swing. (We show the spread in °C rather than a percentage because the average sits near zero, where a percentage would be meaningless.)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The standard deviation of your nightly deviations: how much your skin temperature wanders around your baseline from night to night, in °C. A small number means steady thermoregulation; a larger one means more night-to-night swing. (We show the spread in °C rather than a percentage because the average sits near zero, where a percentage would be meaningless.)"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La desviación estándar de tus desviaciones nocturnas, cuánto se mueve la temperatura de tu piel alrededor de tu base de noche a noche, en °C. Un número chico significa una termorregulación estable; uno más grande, más vaivén de noche a noche. (Mostramos la dispersión en °C y no en porcentaje porque el promedio queda cerca de cero, donde un porcentaje no significaría nada.)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each night your strap records skin temperature. We compare it with a rolling baseline of your own recent nights and report the difference in °C: so the value is always relative to you, not an absolute temperature. The trend and the spread are computed from that same nightly deviation.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each night your strap records skin temperature. We compare it with a rolling baseline of your own recent nights and report the difference in °C: so the value is always relative to you, not an absolute temperature. The trend and the spread are computed from that same nightly deviation."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada noche tu banda registra la temperatura de tu piel. La comparamos con una base móvil de tus propias noches recientes y reportamos la diferencia en °C, así el valor siempre es relativo a ti, no una temperatura absoluta. La tendencia y la dispersión se calculan de esa misma desviación nocturna."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your step count for today. Steady activity, even a short walk, supports your heart, your mood and your recovery.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your step count for today. Steady activity, even a short walk, supports your heart, your mood and your recovery."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu conteo de pasos de hoy. La actividad constante, aunque sea una caminata corta, apoya tu corazón, tu ánimo y tu recuperación."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Apple Watch estimates VO₂max during outdoor walks and runs with a good GPS signal: it isn't recorded by the WHOOP strap.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your Apple Watch estimates VO₂max during outdoor walks and runs with a good GPS signal: it isn't recorded by the WHOOP strap."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu Apple Watch estima el VO₂max en caminatas y carreras al aire libre con buena señal de GPS, la banda WHOOP no lo registra."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The most oxygen your body can use during hard exercise, per kilo of body weight. It's the single best measure of cardiorespiratory fitness, and one of the best-evidenced predictors of long-term health.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The most oxygen your body can use during hard exercise, per kilo of body weight. It's the single best measure of cardiorespiratory fitness, and one of the best-evidenced predictors of long-term health."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El máximo de oxígeno que tu cuerpo puede usar en ejercicio intenso, por kilo de peso. Es la mejor medida de tu condición cardiorrespiratoria, y uno de los predictores de salud a largo plazo mejor fundamentados."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Measured by your Apple Watch during outdoor walks and runs: it isn't recorded by the WHOOP strap.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Measured by your Apple Watch during outdoor walks and runs: it isn't recorded by the WHOOP strap."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo mide tu Apple Watch en caminatas y carreras al aire libre, la banda WHOOP no lo registra."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Apple Watch estimates VO₂max from your heart rate and pace during brisk outdoor walks and runs with a good GPS signal, so it updates every so often rather than daily. We read where it sits among healthy adults of your age and sex (the FRIEND reference median), and translate that into a plain band. A higher VO₂max is associated with a lower risk of all-cause mortality: it's one of the best-evidenced markers of long-term health.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your Apple Watch estimates VO₂max from your heart rate and pace during brisk outdoor walks and runs with a good GPS signal, so it updates every so often rather than daily. We read where it sits among healthy adults of your age and sex (the FRIEND reference median), and translate that into a plain band. A higher VO₂max is associated with a lower risk of all-cause mortality: it's one of the best-evidenced markers of long-term health."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu Apple Watch estima el VO₂max a partir de tu frecuencia cardiaca y tu ritmo en caminatas y carreras al aire libre con buena señal de GPS, así que se actualiza de vez en cuando, no a diario. Leemos dónde cae entre adultos sanos de tu edad y sexo (la mediana de referencia FRIEND) y lo traducimos en una banda sencilla. Un VO₂max más alto se asocia con menor riesgo de mortalidad por todas las causas, es uno de los marcadores de salud a largo plazo mejor fundamentados."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reference: Kaminsky et al., FRIEND Registry (Mayo Clin Proc 2015). Longevity association: Mandsager et al. (JAMA 2018), Kodama et al. (JAMA 2009). A coarse population reference, not a clinical measurement: NOOP is not a medical device.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reference: Kaminsky et al., FRIEND Registry (Mayo Clin Proc 2015). Longevity association: Mandsager et al. (JAMA 2018), Kodama et al. (JAMA 2009). A coarse population reference, not a clinical measurement: NOOP is not a medical device."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Referencia: Kaminsky et al., Registro FRIEND (Mayo Clin Proc 2015). Asociación con longevidad: Mandsager et al. (JAMA 2018), Kodama et al. (JAMA 2009). Es una referencia poblacional aproximada, no una medición clínica, NOOP no es un dispositivo médico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All-out day: about as much strain as you carry.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All-out day: about as much strain as you carry."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Día a tope, casi todo el esfuerzo que aguantas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Day Strain is your cardiovascular load on a 0–21 scale. Each second your heart rate is recorded, it's placed in an intensity zone (1–5); higher zones weigh more, and the total is compressed logarithmically so 21 is a theoretical maximum: a full day at peak intensity. (Edwards 1993; Banister 1991)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Day Strain is your cardiovascular load on a 0–21 scale. Each second your heart rate is recorded, it's placed in an intensity zone (1–5); higher zones weigh more, and the total is compressed logarithmically so 21 is a theoretical maximum: a full day at peak intensity. (Edwards 1993; Banister 1991)"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El Esfuerzo del día es tu carga cardiovascular en una escala de 0 a 21. Cada segundo en que se registra tu frecuencia cardiaca se asigna a una zona de intensidad (1–5); las zonas altas pesan más, y el total se comprime logarítmicamente, así que 21 es un máximo teórico: un día entero a intensidad máxima. (Edwards 1993; Banister 1991)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hard effort today: solid work.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hard effort today: solid work."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esfuerzo fuerte hoy, buen trabajo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Light load today: plenty left in the tank.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Light load today: plenty left in the tank."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Carga ligera hoy, te queda mucho en el tanque."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No strain from today yet: your recent history is below.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No strain from today yet: your recent history is below."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aún no hay esfuerzo de hoy, abajo está tu historial reciente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No reading from last night yet: your recent history is below.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No reading from last night yet: your recent history is below."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aún no hay lectura de anoche, abajo está tu historial reciente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recovery blends several signals from your nervous system, your HRV above all, plus resting heart rate, sleep and breathing, and compares them with your own baseline from recent weeks. It's an estimate of how ready your body is today, not a diagnosis. (Buchheit 2014)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recovery blends several signals from your nervous system, your HRV above all, plus resting heart rate, sleep and breathing, and compares them with your own baseline from recent weeks. It's an estimate of how ready your body is today, not a diagnosis. (Buchheit 2014)"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La recuperación combina varias señales de tu sistema nervioso, tu HRV sobre todo, más la frecuencia cardiaca en reposo, el sueño y la respiración, y las compara con tu propia base de las últimas semanas. Es una estimación de qué tan listo está tu cuerpo hoy, no un diagnóstico. (Buchheit 2014)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Above your baseline: your body is ready for a strong day.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Above your baseline: your body is ready for a strong day."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Por encima de tu base, tu cuerpo está listo para un día fuerte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recovering: train, but keep it controlled.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
