        }
      }
    },
    "Your night moves through four phases. The watch estimates them from your movement and heart rate, so they're approximate: it gets about 2 of 3 right.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your night moves through four phases. The watch estimates them from your movement and heart rate, so they're approximate: it gets about 2 of 3 right."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu noche pasa por cuatro fases. El reloj las estima con tu movimiento y tu ritmo cardiaco, así que son aproximadas: acierta cerca de 2 de cada 3."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The share of your sleep spent in deep and REM: the stages that physically and mentally restore you. Around 40–50% is typical for a healthy adult.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The share of your sleep spent in deep and REM: the stages that physically and mentally restore you. Around 40–50% is typical for a healthy adult."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La parte de tu sueño en profundo y REM, las etapas que te restauran física y mentalmente. Cerca del 40–50% es lo típico en un adulto sano."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many times you briefly woke during the night. A few are completely normal: everyone surfaces between sleep cycles.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How many times you briefly woke during the night. A few are completely normal: everyone surfaces between sleep cycles."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuántas veces te despertaste brevemente durante la noche. Unas pocas son del todo normales: todos salimos a flote entre ciclos de sueño."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cardiovascular load scored 0–21. Each second of the day your heart rate is recorded, it's assigned to a zone (1–5). Higher zones carry more weight. The total is compressed logarithmically so 21 represents a theoretical maximum: a full day at peak intensity.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cardiovascular load scored 0–21. Each second of the day your heart rate is recorded, it's assigned to a zone (1–5). Higher zones carry more weight. The total is compressed logarithmically so 21 represents a theoretical maximum: a full day at peak intensity."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La carga sobre tu corazón a lo largo del día, en una escala de 0 a 21. Cada segundo que se registra tu frecuencia cardíaca cae en una zona (1 a 5); las zonas más altas pesan más. El total se comprime de forma logarítmica, así que 21 es un máximo teórico: un día entero a intensidad máxima."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your heart rate when your body is fully at rest: how hard your heart has to work doing nothing. Lower generally means a stronger, more efficient cardiovascular system. Cénit uses it as ~20% of your recovery score; a rise from your norm can signal fatigue or that something's coming on.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your heart rate when your body is fully at rest: how hard your heart has to work doing nothing. Lower generally means a stronger, more efficient cardiovascular system. Cénit uses it as ~20% of your recovery score; a rise from your norm can signal fatigue or that something's coming on."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu frecuencia cardíaca cuando tu cuerpo está en reposo total: lo que le cuesta latir sin hacer nada. Más baja suele indicar un sistema cardiovascular más fuerte y eficiente. Cénit la usa como cerca del 20% de tu recuperación; una subida respecto a tu norma puede señalar fatiga o que algo se está gestando."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Daily step count. Consistent activity, even a 30-minute walk, supports cardiovascular health, mood, and recovery quality.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Daily step count. Consistent activity, even a 30-minute walk, supports cardiovascular health, mood, and recovery quality."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu conteo de pasos del día. La actividad constante, aunque sea una caminata de 30 minutos, apoya tu salud cardiovascular, tu ánimo y la calidad de tu recuperación."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HRV is personal. There are no universal good/bad thresholds: only your trend over time.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HRV is personal. There are no universal good/bad thresholds: only your trend over time."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La HRV es personal. No hay umbrales universales de bueno o malo, solo tu tendencia en el tiempo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your recovery sums up how ready your body is today, from 0 to 100. It blends several signals from your night, your HRV above all, and compares them with your own average from recent weeks, not anyone else's.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your recovery sums up how ready your body is today, from 0 to 100. It blends several signals from your night, your HRV above all, and compares them with your own average from recent weeks, not anyone else's."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu recuperación resume qué tan listo está tu cuerpo hoy, del 0 al 100. Combina varias señales de tu noche, sobre todo tu HRV, y las compara con tu propio promedio de las últimas semanas, no con el de nadie más."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live HR works: free the strap to unlock buzz, alarms & sync": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Live HR works: free the strap to unlock buzz, alarms & sync"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La FC en vivo funciona, libera la banda para desbloquear vibración, alarmas y sincronización"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect your strap for haptic guidance: you'll feel one pulse on the inhale, two on the exhale, so you can breathe with your eyes closed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connect your strap for haptic guidance: you'll feel one pulse on the inhale, two on the exhale, so you can breathe with your eyes closed."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conecta tu banda para la guía háptica: sentirás un pulso al inhalar y dos al exhalar, para que puedas respirar con los ojos cerrados."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Silent haptic HIIT: the strap buzzes the transitions": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Silent haptic HIIT: the strap buzzes the transitions"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HIIT háptico silencioso, la banda vibra en las transiciones"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On: your recovery, sleep, HRV and workouts are shared with the provider for tailored coaching.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On: your recovery, sleep, HRV and workouts are shared with the provider for tailored coaching."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Encendido, tu recuperación, sueño, HRV y entrenamientos se comparten con el proveedor para un coaching a tu medida."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off: the coach answers generally and sends none of your metrics.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off: the coach answers generally and sends none of your metrics."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apagado, el Coach responde de forma general y no envía ninguna de tus métricas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " No clear relationship: they move largely independently.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " No clear relationship: they move largely independently."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " Sin relación clara, se mueven de forma independiente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Resting HR is elevated and HRV is below your baseline: both classic signs of high activation. Prioritise rest, hydration and an easy day.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Resting HR is elevated and HRV is below your baseline: both classic signs of high activation. Prioritise rest, hydration and an easy day."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La FC en reposo está elevada y la HRV está por debajo de tu línea base, dos señales clásicas de alta activación. Prioriza el descanso, la hidratación y un día tranquilo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Resting heart rate is running high versus your norm: your body is under load today. Keep effort light.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Resting heart rate is running high versus your norm: your body is under load today. Keep effort light."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La frecuencia cardiaca en reposo anda alta respecto a tu norma, tu cuerpo está bajo carga hoy. Mantén el esfuerzo ligero."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're sitting around your typical autonomic baseline: moderate stress, a normal, balanced day.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You're sitting around your typical autonomic baseline: moderate stress, a normal, balanced day."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estás alrededor de tu línea base autonómica típica, estrés moderado, un día normal y equilibrado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Resting heart rate is low and HRV is up: your nervous system looks well-recovered and calm. A great day to push if you want to.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Resting heart rate is low and HRV is up: your nervous system looks well-recovered and calm. A great day to push if you want to."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La frecuencia cardiaca en reposo está baja y la HRV alta, tu sistema nervioso se ve recuperado y en calma. Un gran día para exigirte si quieres."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Resting heart rate and HRV are sitting at or below baseline: low physiological stress. You're in a calm, recovered state.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Resting heart rate and HRV are sitting at or below baseline: low physiological stress. You're in a calm, recovered state."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La frecuencia cardiaca en reposo y la HRV están en tu línea base o por debajo, estrés fisiológico bajo. Estás en un estado tranquilo y recuperado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live heart rate only: finish secure pairing to save the rest": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Live heart rate only: finish secure pairing to save the rest"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Solo frecuencia en vivo, completa el emparejamiento seguro para guardar lo demás"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can't connect: your strap's pairing was reset": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Can't connect: your strap's pairing was reset"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se puede conectar, el emparejamiento de tu banda se restableció"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On WHOOP 5/MG this is experimental: arming is confirmed, but a strap-driven wake-up hasn't been verified yet, so don't rely on it as your only alarm there. WHOOP 4 is the proven path.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On WHOOP 5/MG this is experimental: arming is confirmed, but a strap-driven wake-up hasn't been verified yet, so don't rely on it as your only alarm there. WHOOP 4 is the proven path."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En WHOOP 5/MG esto es experimental, el armado está confirmado, pero aún no se ha verificado un despertar accionado por la banda, así que no dependas de ella como tu única alarma ahí. WHOOP 4 es la vía probada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Complete secure pairing first: the strap won’t offload its history until the encrypted bond is set.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Complete secure pairing first: the strap won’t offload its history until the encrypted bond is set."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Primero completa el emparejamiento seguro, la banda no descargará su historial hasta que se establezca el vínculo cifrado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Data arrives but doesn’t decode: please report.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Data arrives but doesn’t decode: please report."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Llegan datos pero no se decodifican, repórtalo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your autonomic load today, from 0 to 3. We estimate it by comparing today's resting heart rate and HRV with your own 30-day baseline: a higher-than-usual resting HR and a lower-than-usual HRV both push the number up: classic signs your body is activated.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your autonomic load today, from 0 to 3. We estimate it by comparing today's resting heart rate and HRV with your own 30-day baseline: a higher-than-usual resting HR and a lower-than-usual HRV both push the number up: classic signs your body is activated."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu carga autonómica de hoy, del 0 al 3. La estimamos comparando tu frecuencia cardíaca en reposo y tu HRV con tu propia línea base de 30 días: una FC en reposo más alta de lo normal y una HRV más baja empujan el número hacia arriba, señales clásicas de que tu cuerpo está activado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Derived from your overnight resting heart rate and HRV: a transparent proxy for autonomic load, not a clinical stress measure.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Derived from your overnight resting heart rate and HRV: a transparent proxy for autonomic load, not a clinical stress measure."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se deriva de tu frecuencia cardíaca en reposo y tu HRV nocturnas, un proxy transparente de la carga autonómica, no una medida clínica de estrés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Physical age measures only the cardiorespiratory side. This one also weighs sleep, regularity, HRV and steps: so the two can differ.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Physical age measures only the cardiorespiratory side. This one also weighs sleep, regularity, HRV and steps: so the two can differ."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La Edad física mide solo el lado cardiorrespiratorio. Esta también pesa sueño, regularidad, HRV y pasos, por eso pueden no coincidir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep wearing the band a few nights and it appears on its own: we don't show a half-finished number.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep wearing the band a few nights and it appears on its own: we don't show a half-finished number."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sigue usando la banda unas noches y aparece sola, no mostramos un número a medias."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No nights yet. Import your WHOOP export, or connect Apple Health, in Data Sources to see your sleep stages and trends. Or wear the strap to bed and open it again after the strap syncs.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No nights yet. Import your WHOOP export, or connect Apple Health, in Data Sources to see your sleep stages and trends. Or wear the strap to bed and open it again after the strap syncs."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aún no hay noches. Importa tu exportación de WHOOP, o conecta Apple Salud, en Fuentes de datos para ver tus etapas y tendencias de sueño. O usa la banda al dormir y ábrelo de nuevo cuando la banda se sincronice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No stress reading yet. Wear your strap overnight and open this again after it syncs, or import your WHOOP history in Data Sources. Stress is read from your resting heart rate and HRV.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No stress reading yet. Wear your strap overnight and open this again after it syncs, or import your WHOOP history in Data Sources. Stress is read from your resting heart rate and HRV."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aún no hay lectura de estrés. Usa tu banda de noche y vuelve a abrir esto cuando sincronice, o importa tu historial de WHOOP en Fuentes de datos. El estrés se lee de tu frecuencia en reposo y tu HRV."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wrist optical sensors are less accurate than medical pulse oximeters: read this as a trend, not a clinical measurement. NOOP is not a medical device.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wrist optical sensors are less accurate than medical pulse oximeters: read this as a trend, not a clinical measurement. NOOP is not a medical device."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los sensores ópticos de muñeca son menos precisos que un oxímetro médico, léelo como tendencia, no como una medición clínica. NOOP no es un dispositivo médico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your routines are created on your iPhone. NOOP never connects: you run the AI step yourself.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your routines are created on your iPhone. NOOP never connects: you run the AI step yourself."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tus rutinas se crean en tu iPhone. NOOP nunca se conecta, el paso de la IA lo haces tú."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The plan's unit isn't supported: it must be kg or lb.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The plan's unit isn't supported: it must be kg or lb."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La unidad del plan no es compatible, debe ser kg o lb."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Worked out without HRV or resting heart rate: the two heaviest signals. The number still holds, with less precision.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Worked out without HRV or resting heart rate: the two heaviest signals. The number still holds, with less precision."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Calculada sin HRV ni FC en reposo, las dos señales de mayor peso. El número sigue valiendo, con menos precisión."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Worked out without HRV: one of the heaviest signals. The number still holds, with less precision.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Worked out without HRV: one of the heaviest signals. The number still holds, with less precision."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Calculada sin HRV, una de las señales de mayor peso. El número sigue valiendo, con menos precisión."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Worked out without resting heart rate: one of the heaviest signals. The number still holds, with less precision.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Worked out without resting heart rate: one of the heaviest signals. The number still holds, with less precision."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Calculada sin FC en reposo, una de las señales de mayor peso. El número sigue valiendo, con menos precisión."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last night's reading was short, so it only covers the respiratory part: not the slow waves.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Last night's reading was short, so it only covers the respiratory part: not the slow waves."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anoche la lectura fue corta, así que solo alcanza para la parte respiratoria, no para las ondas lentas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Computed from last night's heartbeats (Lomb-Scargle). These are descriptive band powers to compare against yourself: not a diagnosis or a “stress balance.”": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Computed from last night's heartbeats (Lomb-Scargle). These are descriptive band powers to compare against yourself: not a diagnosis or a “stress balance.”"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Calculado de los latidos de anoche (Lomb-Scargle). Son potencias descriptivas para compararte contigo mismo, no un diagnóstico ni un «balance de estrés»."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A marked, early drop: a sign you settled into rest. It's a pattern, not a diagnosis.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A marked, early drop: a sign you settled into rest. It's a pattern, not a diagnosis."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un descenso marcado y temprano: señal de que descansaste. Es un patrón, no un diagnóstico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We show you the direction, not an exact number: the estimate jumps day to day, the trend is more honest.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We show you the direction, not an exact number: the estimate jumps day to day, the trend is more honest."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Te enseñamos la dirección, no un número exacto: el estimado brinca de día a día, la tendencia es más honesta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This recovery is ESTIMATED from your Apple Watch HRV (SDNN) and sleep on a night your band didn't record, compared with your own Apple-Health baseline. SDNN isn't the same measure as the band's HRV, so it's a lower-confidence proxy: read it as a guide, not a band reading. Not a diagnosis.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This recovery is ESTIMATED from your Apple Watch HRV (SDNN) and sleep on a night your band didn't record, compared with your own Apple-Health baseline. SDNN isn't the same measure as the band's HRV, so it's a lower-confidence proxy: read it as a guide, not a band reading. Not a diagnosis."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esta recuperación es ESTIMADA a partir del HRV (SDNN) y el sueño de tu Apple Watch en una noche que tu banda no registró, comparado con tu propia base de Apple Salud. El SDNN no es la misma medida que el HRV de la banda, así que es una estimación de menor confianza, tómalo como guía, no como una lectura de la banda. No es un diagnóstico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This recovery is ESTIMATED from your Apple Watch HRV (SDNN) and sleep while your band is still calibrating its own baseline, compared with your own Apple-Health baseline. SDNN isn't the same measure as the band's HRV, so it's a lower-confidence proxy: read it as a guide, not a band reading. It switches to your band automatically once it's calibrated. Not a diagnosis.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This recovery is ESTIMATED from your Apple Watch HRV (SDNN) and sleep while your band is still calibrating its own baseline, compared with your own Apple-Health baseline. SDNN isn't the same measure as the band's HRV, so it's a lower-confidence proxy: read it as a guide, not a band reading. It switches to your band automatically once it's calibrated. Not a diagnosis."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esta recuperación es ESTIMADA a partir del HRV (SDNN) y el sueño de tu Apple Watch mientras tu banda aún calibra su propia base, comparado con tu propia base de Apple Salud. El SDNN no es la misma medida que el HRV de la banda, así que es una estimación de menor confianza, tómalo como guía, no como una lectura de la banda. Cambia a tu banda automáticamente en cuanto calibra. No es un diagnóstico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
