    "95% is the typical floor for a healthy adult — the same reference for everyone, not your personal baseline. Below 90% is considered low (hypoxemia). The wrist sensor is less precise than a medical oximeter, so read it as a trend.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "95% is the typical floor for a healthy adult — the same reference for everyone, not your personal baseline. Below 90% is considered low (hypoxemia). The wrist sensor is less precise than a medical oximeter, so read it as a trend."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El 95% es el piso típico de un adulto sano, la misma referencia para todos, no tu base personal. Debajo de 90% se considera bajo (hipoxemia). El sensor de muñeca es menos preciso que un oxímetro médico, así que léelo como tendencia."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A gentle buzz when your HRV drops while your heart rate is calm — a cue to take a paced breath. Rate-limited to once every 15 minutes; off by default.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A gentle buzz when your HRV drops while your heart rate is calm — a cue to take a paced breath. Rate-limited to once every 15 minutes; off by default."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un zumbido suave cuando tu HRV baja mientras tu pulso está en calma, una señal para respirar con calma. Limitado a una vez cada 15 minutos; apagado por defecto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Above the recommended band — a lot of volume this week.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Above the recommended band — a lot of volume this week."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Por encima de la banda recomendada: mucho volumen esta semana."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Above your baseline — your body is ready for a strong day.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Above your baseline — your body is ready for a strong day."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Por encima de tu base, tu cuerpo está listo para un día fuerte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After a long sit with no walking around, the strap buzzes on its next sync. It measures a lack of walking, not wrist stillness — typing at a desk still counts as sitting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tras un rato largo sentado sin caminar, la banda zumba en su próxima sincronización. Mide la falta de caminata, no la quietud de la muñeca, teclear en el escritorio sigue contando como estar sentado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All-out day — about as much strain as you carry.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All-out day — about as much strain as you carry."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Día a tope, casi todo el esfuerzo que aguantas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Anoche dormiste menos de 6 h. Una noche corta deprime tu HRV e infla tu frecuencia en reposo aunque tu recuperación real sea mejor — así que hoy el número se lee con menos certeza. No es que estés peor: una noche corta se mide con menos confianza.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Last night you slept under 6 h. A short night suppresses your HRV and inflates your resting heart rate even when your real recovery is better — so today's number reads with less certainty. It doesn't mean you're worse off: a short night is just measured with less confidence."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anoche dormiste menos de 6 h. Una noche corta deprime tu HRV e infla tu frecuencia en reposo aunque tu recuperación real sea mejor, así que hoy el número se lee con menos certeza. No es que estés peor: una noche corta se mide con menos confianza."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Association, not cause — moving together isn't one driving the other.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Association, not cause — moving together isn't one driving the other."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Asociación, no causa, moverse juntas no es que una empuje a la otra."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Association, not cause — these move together, neither drives the other.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Association, not cause — these move together, neither drives the other."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Asociación, no causa, se mueven juntas, ninguna empuja a la otra."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Below the recommended band — room for more volume this week.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
