            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Candidato, aún sin experimento"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cardiovascular load scored 0–21. Each second of the day your heart rate is recorded, it's assigned to a zone (1–5). Higher zones carry more weight. The total is compressed logarithmically so 21 represents a theoretical maximum — a full day at peak intensity.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cardiovascular load scored 0–21. Each second of the day your heart rate is recorded, it's assigned to a zone (1–5). Higher zones carry more weight. The total is compressed logarithmically so 21 represents a theoretical maximum — a full day at peak intensity."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La carga sobre tu corazón a lo largo del día, en una escala de 0 a 21. Cada segundo que se registra tu frecuencia cardíaca cae en una zona (1 a 5); las zonas más altas pesan más. El total se comprime de forma logarítmica, así que 21 es un máximo teórico: un día entero a intensidad máxima."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Complete secure pairing first — the strap won’t offload its history until the encrypted bond is set.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Complete secure pairing first — the strap won’t offload its history until the encrypted bond is set."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Primero completa el emparejamiento seguro, la banda no descargará su historial hasta que se establezca el vínculo cifrado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Computed from last night's heartbeats (Lomb-Scargle). These are descriptive band powers to compare against yourself — not a diagnosis or a “stress balance.”": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Computed from last night's heartbeats (Lomb-Scargle). These are descriptive band powers to compare against yourself — not a diagnosis or a “stress balance.”"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Calculado de los latidos de anoche (Lomb-Scargle). Son potencias descriptivas para compararte contigo mismo, no un diagnóstico ni un «balance de estrés»."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Confianza baja — noche corta": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Low confidence — short night"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Confianza baja, noche corta"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect your strap for haptic guidance — you'll feel one pulse on the inhale, two on the exhale, so you can breathe with your eyes closed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connect your strap for haptic guidance — you'll feel one pulse on the inhale, two on the exhale, so you can breathe with your eyes closed."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conecta tu banda para la guía háptica: sentirás un pulso al inhalar y dos al exhalar, para que puedas respirar con los ojos cerrados."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cénit reads your blood oxygen from Apple Health — your strap senses it optically at the wrist, but Cénit doesn't turn that into a percentage on its own. A healthy adult typically sits at 95–100%; readings below 90% are considered low (hypoxemia). Isolated low nights are usually noise — altitude, a cold, or how the sensor sat. A sustained run of low nights is what's worth a look with a finger pulse oximeter.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cénit reads your blood oxygen from Apple Health — your strap senses it optically at the wrist, but Cénit doesn't turn that into a percentage on its own. A healthy adult typically sits at 95–100%; readings below 90% are considered low (hypoxemia). Isolated low nights are usually noise — altitude, a cold, or how the sensor sat. A sustained run of low nights is what's worth a look with a finger pulse oximeter."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cénit lee tu oxígeno en sangre desde Apple Salud, tu banda lo detecta ópticamente en la muñeca, pero Cénit no lo convierte en porcentaje por su cuenta. Un adulto sano suele estar en 95–100%; lecturas por debajo de 90% se consideran bajas (hipoxemia). Las noches bajas aisladas suelen ser ruido, altitud, un resfriado, o cómo quedó el sensor. Una racha sostenida de noches bajas es lo que amerita revisarse con un oxímetro de dedo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Daily step count. Consistent activity — even a 30-minute walk — supports cardiovascular health, mood, and recovery quality.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Daily step count. Consistent activity — even a 30-minute walk — supports cardiovascular health, mood, and recovery quality."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu conteo de pasos del día. La actividad constante, aunque sea una caminata de 30 minutos, apoya tu salud cardiovascular, tu ánimo y la calidad de tu recuperación."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Data arrives but doesn’t decode — please report.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Data arrives but doesn’t decode — please report."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Llegan datos pero no se decodifican, repórtalo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Day Strain is your cardiovascular load on a 0–21 scale. Each second your heart rate is recorded, it's placed in an intensity zone (1–5); higher zones weigh more, and the total is compressed logarithmically so 21 is a theoretical maximum — a full day at peak intensity. (Edwards 1993; Banister 1991)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Day Strain is your cardiovascular load on a 0–21 scale. Each second your heart rate is recorded, it's placed in an intensity zone (1–5); higher zones weigh more, and the total is compressed logarithmically so 21 is a theoretical maximum — a full day at peak intensity. (Edwards 1993; Banister 1991)"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El Esfuerzo del día es tu carga cardiovascular en una escala de 0 a 21. Cada segundo en que se registra tu frecuencia cardiaca se asigna a una zona de intensidad (1–5); las zonas altas pesan más, y el total se comprime logarítmicamente, así que 21 es un máximo teórico: un día entero a intensidad máxima. (Edwards 1993; Banister 1991)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Derived from your overnight resting heart rate and HRV — a transparent proxy for autonomic load, not a clinical stress measure.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Derived from your overnight resting heart rate and HRV — a transparent proxy for autonomic load, not a clinical stress measure."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se deriva de tu frecuencia cardíaca en reposo y tu HRV nocturnas, un proxy transparente de la carga autonómica, no una medida clínica de estrés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each night your strap records skin temperature. We compare it with a rolling baseline of your own recent nights and report the difference in °C — so the value is always relative to you, not an absolute temperature. The trend and the spread are computed from that same nightly deviation.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each night your strap records skin temperature. We compare it with a rolling baseline of your own recent nights and report the difference in °C — so the value is always relative to you, not an absolute temperature. The trend and the spread are computed from that same nightly deviation."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada noche tu banda registra la temperatura de tu piel. La comparamos con una base móvil de tus propias noches recientes y reportamos la diferencia en °C, así el valor siempre es relativo a ti, no una temperatura absoluta. La tendencia y la dispersión se calculan de esa misma desviación nocturna."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each point is one night's deviation from your baseline. The shaded band is your own typical night-to-night swing (±1 SD around 0) — inside it is business as usual; a run of nights poking out the same side is the signal. Average and the range come from the period you pick; the chip compares this period's average with the previous period of the same length, in °C.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each point is one night's deviation from your baseline. The shaded band is your own typical night-to-night swing (±1 SD around 0) — inside it is business as usual; a run of nights poking out the same side is the signal. Average and the range come from the period you pick; the chip compares this period's average with the previous period of the same length, in °C."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada punto es la desviación de una noche respecto a tu base. La banda sombreada es tu propio vaivén típico de noche a noche (±1 DE alrededor de 0), dentro de ella es lo normal; varias noches seguidas saliéndose por el mismo lado son la señal. El promedio y el rango salen del periodo que elijas; el chip compara el promedio de este periodo con el del periodo anterior del mismo largo, en °C."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each signal becomes a score of how far above or below your personal average it sits (a z-score, in σ). They're averaged with fixed weights — HRV 60%, resting heart rate 20%, sleep 15%, skin temperature 10%, respiration 5% — and mapped onto a 0–100 scale, calibrated so a typical day lands near 58. If a signal is missing on a given night, its weight is shared among the others.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each signal becomes a score of how far above or below your personal average it sits (a z-score, in σ). They're averaged with fixed weights — HRV 60%, resting heart rate 20%, sleep 15%, skin temperature 10%, respiration 5% — and mapped onto a 0–100 scale, calibrated so a typical day lands near 58. If a signal is missing on a given night, its weight is shared among the others."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada señal se convierte en un puntaje de qué tan por arriba o por abajo de tu promedio personal quedó (un z-score, en σ). Se promedian con pesos fijos, HRV 60%, FC en reposo 20%, sueño 15%, temperatura de la piel 10%, respiración 5%, y se mapean a una escala de 0 a 100, calibrada para que un día típico caiga cerca de 58. Si una señal falta una noche, su peso se reparte entre las demás."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Effort (0–21 scale) is computed only by your WHOOP — this session doesn't carry it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Effort (0–21 scale) is computed only by your WHOOP — this session doesn't carry it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El esfuerzo (escala 0–21) solo lo calcula tu banda, esta sesión no lo trae."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fresh and ready — a good muscle to train today.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fresh and ready — a good muscle to train today."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fresco y listo: un buen músculo para entrenar hoy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HRV is personal. There are no universal good/bad thresholds — only your trend over time.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HRV is personal. There are no universal good/bad thresholds — only your trend over time."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La HRV es personal. No hay umbrales universales de bueno o malo, solo tu tendencia en el tiempo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hard effort today — solid work.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hard effort today — solid work."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esfuerzo fuerte hoy, buen trabajo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far last night's skin temperature ran from your own recent baseline, in °C. We learn your normal over recent nights, so 0 is your usual and the number is the shift up or down. A single warm or cool night rarely means much — what's worth noticing is several nights in a row drifting the same way. It's a comfort signal, not a thermometer or a diagnosis.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How far last night's skin temperature ran from your own recent baseline, in °C. We learn your normal over recent nights, so 0 is your usual and the number is the shift up or down. A single warm or cool night rarely means much — what's worth noticing is several nights in a row drifting the same way. It's a comfort signal, not a thermometer or a diagnosis."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qué tanto se alejó la temperatura de tu piel anoche de tu propia base reciente, en °C. Aprendemos tu normal de las últimas noches, así que 0 es lo de siempre y el número es cuánto subió o bajó. Una sola noche cálida o fría rara vez significa algo, lo que vale la pena notar son varias noches seguidas moviéndose hacia el mismo lado. Es una señal de confort, no un termómetro ni un diagnóstico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many times you briefly woke during the night. A few are completely normal — everyone surfaces between sleep cycles.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How many times you briefly woke during the night. A few are completely normal — everyone surfaces between sleep cycles."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuántas veces te despertaste brevemente durante la noche. Unas pocas son del todo normales: todos salimos a flote entre ciclos de sueño."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm still learning your rhythm — I need a few days of waking readings to mark your peaks. Your events are already here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'm still learning your rhythm — I need a few days of waking readings to mark your peaks. Your events are already here."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aún estoy aprendiendo tu ritmo, necesito unos días de lecturas de vigilia para marcar tus picos. Tus eventos ya están aquí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's charged and worn — the sensor wakes with skin contact.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's charged and worn — the sensor wakes with skin contact."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Está cargada y puesta, el sensor despierta con la piel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep wearing the band a few nights and it appears on its own — we don't show a half-finished number.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep wearing the band a few nights and it appears on its own — we don't show a half-finished number."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sigue usando la banda unas noches y aparece sola, no mostramos un número a medias."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last night's reading was short, so it only covers the respiratory part — not the slow waves.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Last night's reading was short, so it only covers the respiratory part — not the slow waves."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anoche la lectura fue corta, así que solo alcanza para la parte respiratoria, no para las ondas lentas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Light load today — plenty left in the tank.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Light load today — plenty left in the tank."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Carga ligera hoy, te queda mucho en el tanque."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live HR works — free the strap to unlock buzz, alarms & sync": {
      "comment": "A hint to pair the Live HR strap.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La FC en vivo funciona, libera la banda para desbloquear vibración, alarmas y sincronización"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live heart rate only — finish secure pairing to save the rest": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Live heart rate only — finish secure pairing to save the rest"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Solo frecuencia en vivo, completa el emparejamiento seguro para guardar lo demás"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Low — prioritize rest today.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Low — prioritize rest today."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Baja, hoy prioriza el descanso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make the strap do things — tap to act, train by feel, wake to a buzz.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Make the strap do things — tap to act, train by feel, wake to a buzz."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Haz que la banda haga cosas, toca para actuar, entrena por sensación, despierta con un zumbido."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Measured by your Apple Watch during outdoor walks and runs — it isn't recorded by the WHOOP strap.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Measured by your Apple Watch during outdoor walks and runs — it isn't recorded by the WHOOP strap."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo mide tu Apple Watch en caminatas y carreras al aire libre, la banda WHOOP no lo registra."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needs at least 14 days of history. When two or more signals drift together you get a notification — at most once a day.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Needs at least 14 days of history. When two or more signals drift together you get a notification — at most once a day."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Necesita al menos 14 días de historial. Cuando dos o más señales se desvían juntas, recibes una notificación, máximo una vez al día."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No Apple Health data imported yet — tap Sync now to pull your recent history.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No Apple Health data imported yet — tap Sync now to pull your recent history."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aún no has importado datos de Apple Salud: toca Sincronizar ahora para traer tu historial reciente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No events today and no stress readings yet — your curve fills in as your strap syncs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No events today and no stress readings yet — your curve fills in as your strap syncs."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hoy no hay eventos ni lecturas de estrés todavía, tu curva se llena conforme tu banda sincroniza."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No nights yet. Import your WHOOP export — or connect Apple Health — in Data Sources to see your sleep stages and trends. Or wear the strap to bed and open it again after the strap syncs.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No nights yet. Import your WHOOP export — or connect Apple Health — in Data Sources to see your sleep stages and trends. Or wear the strap to bed and open it again after the strap syncs."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aún no hay noches. Importa tu exportación de WHOOP, o conecta Apple Salud, en Fuentes de datos para ver tus etapas y tendencias de sueño. O usa la banda al dormir y ábrelo de nuevo cuando la banda se sincronice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No reading from last night yet — your recent history is below.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
