    },
    "Off — the coach answers generally and sends none of your metrics.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off — the coach answers generally and sends none of your metrics."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apagado, el Coach responde de forma general y no envía ninguna de tus métricas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On WHOOP 5/MG this is experimental — arming is confirmed, but a strap-driven wake-up hasn't been verified yet, so don't rely on it as your only alarm there. WHOOP 4 is the proven path.": {
      "comment": "A description of the smart alarm feature.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En WHOOP 5/MG esto es experimental, el armado está confirmado, pero aún no se ha verificado un despertar accionado por la banda, así que no dependas de ella como tu única alarma ahí. WHOOP 4 es la vía probada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On — your recovery, sleep, HRV and workouts are shared with the provider for tailored coaching.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On — your recovery, sleep, HRV and workouts are shared with the provider for tailored coaching."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Encendido, tu recuperación, sueño, HRV y entrenamientos se comparten con el proveedor para un coaching a tu medida."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One of the meals has invalid days — use weekday numbers 1–7. Check the file and try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One of the meals has invalid days — use weekday numbers 1–7. Check the file and try again."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una comida tiene días inválidos, usa números de día 1–7. Revisa el archivo e inténtalo de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only one reading in this range — not enough to draw a line yet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only one reading in this range — not enough to draw a line yet."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Solo una lectura en este rango, aún no alcanza para trazar una línea."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pairs directly with your strap over Bluetooth — no WHOOP app, no cloud.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pairs directly with your strap over Bluetooth — no WHOOP app, no cloud."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se vincula directo con tu banda por Bluetooth, sin app de WHOOP, sin nube."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Physical age measures only the cardiorespiratory side. This one also weighs sleep, regularity, HRV and steps — so the two can differ.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Physical age measures only the cardiorespiratory side. This one also weighs sleep, regularity, HRV and steps — so the two can differ."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La Edad física mide solo el lado cardiorrespiratorio. Esta también pesa sueño, regularidad, HRV y pasos, por eso pueden no coincidir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Presence automation — set a Focus, pause media, set away…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence automation — set a Focus, pause media, set away…"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatización de presencia, activa un modo de Concentración, pausa el audio, márcate ausente…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recovering — train, but keep it controlled.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recovering — train, but keep it controlled."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recuperándote, entrena, pero con cabeza."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recovery blends several signals from your nervous system — your HRV above all, plus resting heart rate, sleep and breathing — and compares them with your own baseline from recent weeks. It's an estimate of how ready your body is today, not a diagnosis. (Buchheit 2014)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recovery blends several signals from your nervous system — your HRV above all, plus resting heart rate, sleep and breathing — and compares them with your own baseline from recent weeks. It's an estimate of how ready your body is today, not a diagnosis. (Buchheit 2014)"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La recuperación combina varias señales de tu sistema nervioso, tu HRV sobre todo, más la frecuencia cardiaca en reposo, el sueño y la respiración, y las compara con tu propia base de las últimas semanas. Es una estimación de qué tan listo está tu cuerpo hoy, no un diagnóstico. (Buchheit 2014)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reference: Kaminsky et al., FRIEND Registry (Mayo Clin Proc 2015). Longevity association: Mandsager et al. (JAMA 2018), Kodama et al. (JAMA 2009). A coarse population reference, not a clinical measurement — NOOP is not a medical device.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reference: Kaminsky et al., FRIEND Registry (Mayo Clin Proc 2015). Longevity association: Mandsager et al. (JAMA 2018), Kodama et al. (JAMA 2009). A coarse population reference, not a clinical measurement — NOOP is not a medical device."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Referencia: Kaminsky et al., Registro FRIEND (Mayo Clin Proc 2015). Asociación con longevidad: Mandsager et al. (JAMA 2018), Kodama et al. (JAMA 2009). Es una referencia poblacional aproximada, no una medición clínica, NOOP no es un dispositivo médico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rest day — your plan has no meals today. Come back tomorrow or use ‹ ›.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rest day — your plan has no meals today. Come back tomorrow or use ‹ ›."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Día libre, tu plan no tiene comidas hoy. Vuelve mañana o usa ‹ ›."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Resting HR is elevated and HRV is below your baseline — both classic signs of high activation. Prioritise rest, hydration and an easy day.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Resting HR is elevated and HRV is below your baseline — both classic signs of high activation. Prioritise rest, hydration and an easy day."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La FC en reposo está elevada y la HRV está por debajo de tu línea base, dos señales clásicas de alta activación. Prioriza el descanso, la hidratación y un día tranquilo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Resting heart rate and HRV are sitting at or below baseline — low physiological stress. You're in a calm, recovered state.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Resting heart rate and HRV are sitting at or below baseline — low physiological stress. You're in a calm, recovered state."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La frecuencia cardiaca en reposo y la HRV están en tu línea base o por debajo, estrés fisiológico bajo. Estás en un estado tranquilo y recuperado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Resting heart rate is low and HRV is up — your nervous system looks well-recovered and calm. A great day to push if you want to.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Resting heart rate is low and HRV is up — your nervous system looks well-recovered and calm. A great day to push if you want to."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La frecuencia cardiaca en reposo está baja y la HRV alta, tu sistema nervioso se ve recuperado y en calma. Un gran día para exigirte si quieres."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Resting heart rate is running high versus your norm — your body is under load today. Keep effort light.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Resting heart rate is running high versus your norm — your body is under load today. Keep effort light."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La frecuencia cardiaca en reposo anda alta respecto a tu norma, tu cuerpo está bajo carga hoy. Mantén el esfuerzo ligero."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run a Shortcut when the strap comes off or goes back on — set a Focus, pause media, mark yourself away.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Run a Shortcut when the strap comes off or goes back on — set a Focus, pause media, mark yourself away."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ejecuta un atajo cuando te quitas o te pones la banda, activa un modo de Concentración, pausa el audio, márcate ausente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scale 0–21, WHOOP-style: it grows logarithmically — not a physical unit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scale 0–21, WHOOP-style: it grows logarithmically — not a physical unit."
          }
        },
        "es": {
