            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Escala 0–21, tipo WHOOP: crece de forma logarítmica, no es una unidad física."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Silence the nudges during a window you choose — a meeting block, an evening wind-down.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Silencia los avisos en una franja que elijas, un bloque de juntas, la calma de la noche."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Silent haptic HIIT — the strap buzzes the transitions": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Silent haptic HIIT — the strap buzzes the transitions"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HIIT háptico silencioso, la banda vibra en las transiciones"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steps come from Apple Health. The detail reads each day's total and smooths it into a 7-day trend, so weekday/weekend swings don't drown out the direction you're heading. Research links roughly 7,000–9,000 steps a day with lower mortality, with the benefit leveling off beyond that — there is nothing magic about exactly 10,000.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steps come from Apple Health. The detail reads each day's total and smooths it into a 7-day trend, so weekday/weekend swings don't drown out the direction you're heading. Research links roughly 7,000–9,000 steps a day with lower mortality, with the benefit leveling off beyond that — there is nothing magic about exactly 10,000."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los pasos vienen de Apple Salud. El detalle toma el total de cada día y lo suaviza en una tendencia de 7 días, para que los altibajos entre semana y fin de semana no tapen hacia dónde vas. La investigación asocia entre 7,000 y 9,000 pasos al día con menor mortalidad, y el beneficio se aplana más allá de eso: no hay nada mágico en los 10,000 exactos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steps, heart, sleep, body composition and VO₂ max — read locally on this iPhone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steps, heart, sleep, body composition and VO₂ max — read locally on this iPhone."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pasos, corazón, sueño, composición corporal y VO₂ máx, leídos localmente en este iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Still loaded — give it a day or two before training it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Still loaded — give it a day or two before training it again."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aún cargado: dale uno o dos días antes de volver a entrenarlo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sync the last few weeks two-way, on-device: Cénit reads your Apple Health HR, HRV, sleep, SpO₂ and steps, and writes its own strap-derived metrics back. Strictly opt-in — nothing leaves your iPhone. (For a one-time bulk history, use the export import above.)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sync the last few weeks two-way, on-device: Cénit reads your Apple Health HR, HRV, sleep, SpO₂ and steps, and writes its own strap-derived metrics back. Strictly opt-in — nothing leaves your iPhone. (For a one-time bulk history, use the export import above.)"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sincroniza las últimas semanas en ambos sentidos, en el dispositivo: Cénit lee tu FC, HRV, sueño, SpO₂ y pasos de Apple Health, y escribe de vuelta sus propias métricas derivadas de la banda. Estrictamente opcional, nada sale de tu iPhone. (Para un historial masivo de una vez, usa la importación de exportación de arriba.)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That plan's cycle isn't supported — it must be daily or weekly.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That plan's cycle isn't supported — it must be daily or weekly."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El ciclo de ese plan no es válido, debe ser diario o semanal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The map resets to fresh. Your workout history isn't deleted — logging a new workout loads that muscle again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The map resets to fresh. Your workout history isn't deleted — logging a new workout loads that muscle again."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El mapa vuelve a fresco. No se borra tu historial de entrenamientos: al registrar un nuevo entrenamiento, ese músculo se vuelve a cargar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The most oxygen your body can use during hard exercise, per kilo of body weight. It's the single best measure of cardiorespiratory fitness — and one of the best-evidenced predictors of long-term health.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The most oxygen your body can use during hard exercise, per kilo of body weight. It's the single best measure of cardiorespiratory fitness — and one of the best-evidenced predictors of long-term health."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El máximo de oxígeno que tu cuerpo puede usar en ejercicio intenso, por kilo de peso. Es la mejor medida de tu condición cardiorrespiratoria, y uno de los predictores de salud a largo plazo mejor fundamentados."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The plan's language isn't supported — it must be Spanish or English.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The plan's language isn't supported — it must be Spanish or English."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El idioma del plan no es compatible, debe ser español o inglés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The plan's unit isn't supported — it must be kg or lb.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The plan's unit isn't supported — it must be kg or lb."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La unidad del plan no es compatible, debe ser kg o lb."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The ratio compares your average load over the last ~7 days against your last ~28 — the acute:chronic workload ratio (ACWR). 1.0 means you trained exactly your usual; 0.8–1.3 reads as balanced (Gabbett 2016). It's a debated heuristic and does not predict injuries (Impellizzeri 2020).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The ratio compares your average load over the last ~7 days against your last ~28 — the acute:chronic workload ratio (ACWR). 1.0 means you trained exactly your usual; 0.8–1.3 reads as balanced (Gabbett 2016). It's a debated heuristic and does not predict injuries (Impellizzeri 2020)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La razón compara tu carga promedio de los últimos ~7 días contra tus últimos ~28 (la razón de carga aguda:crónica, ACWR). 1.0 significa que entrenaste exactamente tu normal; 0.8–1.3 se lee como equilibrio (Gabbett 2016). Es una heurística debatida y no predice lesiones (Impellizzeri 2020)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The share of your sleep spent in deep and REM — the stages that physically and mentally restore you. Around 40–50% is typical for a healthy adult.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The share of your sleep spent in deep and REM — the stages that physically and mentally restore you. Around 40–50% is typical for a healthy adult."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La parte de tu sueño en profundo y REM, las etapas que te restauran física y mentalmente. Cerca del 40–50% es lo típico en un adulto sano."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The standard deviation of your nightly deviations — how much your skin temperature wanders around your baseline from night to night, in °C. A small number means steady thermoregulation; a larger one means more night-to-night swing. (We show the spread in °C rather than a percentage because the average sits near zero, where a percentage would be meaningless.)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The standard deviation of your nightly deviations — how much your skin temperature wanders around your baseline from night to night, in °C. A small number means steady thermoregulation; a larger one means more night-to-night swing. (We show the spread in °C rather than a percentage because the average sits near zero, where a percentage would be meaningless.)"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La desviación estándar de tus desviaciones nocturnas, cuánto se mueve la temperatura de tu piel alrededor de tu base de noche a noche, en °C. Un número chico significa una termorregulación estable; uno más grande, más vaivén de noche a noche. (Mostramos la dispersión en °C y no en porcentaje porque el promedio queda cerca de cero, donde un porcentaje no significaría nada.)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They come from your WHOOP and Apple Health history. Import them in Data Sources — or add one you tracked elsewhere.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "They come from your WHOOP and Apple Health history. Import them in Data Sources — or add one you tracked elsewhere."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vienen de tu historial de WHOOP y Apple Salud. Impórtalos en Orígenes de datos, o agrega uno que registraste en otro lado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This erases everything you contributed — your day journal and all your experiments (with their verdicts). The patterns detected from your body stay, and your imported WHOOP history is untouched. This can't be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esto borra todo lo que aportaste, tu diario y todos tus experimentos (con sus veredictos). Los patrones detectados de tu cuerpo se quedan, y tu historial importado de WHOOP no se toca. No se puede deshacer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This recovery is ESTIMATED from your Apple Watch HRV (SDNN) and sleep on a night your band didn't record, compared with your own Apple-Health baseline. SDNN isn't the same measure as the band's HRV, so it's a lower-confidence proxy — read it as a guide, not a band reading. Not a diagnosis.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This recovery is ESTIMATED from your Apple Watch HRV (SDNN) and sleep on a night your band didn't record, compared with your own Apple-Health baseline. SDNN isn't the same measure as the band's HRV, so it's a lower-confidence proxy — read it as a guide, not a band reading. Not a diagnosis."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esta recuperación es ESTIMADA a partir del HRV (SDNN) y el sueño de tu Apple Watch en una noche que tu banda no registró, comparado con tu propia base de Apple Salud. El SDNN no es la misma medida que el HRV de la banda, así que es una estimación de menor confianza, tómalo como guía, no como una lectura de la banda. No es un diagnóstico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This recovery is ESTIMATED from your Apple Watch HRV (SDNN) and sleep while your band is still calibrating its own baseline, compared with your own Apple-Health baseline. SDNN isn't the same measure as the band's HRV, so it's a lower-confidence proxy — read it as a guide, not a band reading. It switches to your band automatically once it's calibrated. Not a diagnosis.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This recovery is ESTIMATED from your Apple Watch HRV (SDNN) and sleep while your band is still calibrating its own baseline, compared with your own Apple-Health baseline. SDNN isn't the same measure as the band's HRV, so it's a lower-confidence proxy — read it as a guide, not a band reading. It switches to your band automatically once it's calibrated. Not a diagnosis."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esta recuperación es ESTIMADA a partir del HRV (SDNN) y el sueño de tu Apple Watch mientras tu banda aún calibra su propia base, comparado con tu propia base de Apple Salud. El SDNN no es la misma medida que el HRV de la banda, así que es una estimación de menor confianza, tómalo como guía, no como una lectura de la banda. Cambia a tu banda automáticamente en cuanto calibra. No es un diagnóstico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Train by feel — the strap buzzes so you don't have to watch a screen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Train by feel — the strap buzzes so you don't have to watch a screen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entrena por sensación, la banda zumba para que no tengas que mirar una pantalla."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WHOOP straps don't show up in your iPhone's Settings › Bluetooth — they use a custom profile only apps like Cénit can see. There's nothing to pair there.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WHOOP straps don't show up in your iPhone's Settings › Bluetooth — they use a custom profile only apps like Cénit can see. There's nothing to pair there."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las bandas no salen en Ajustes › Bluetooth de tu iPhone, usan un perfil propio que solo apps como Cénit pueden ver. No hay nada que emparejar ahí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watches your resting HR, HRV, skin temperature and respiration against your own 28-day baseline. On-device and approximate — informational only, not a diagnosis.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Watches your resting HR, HRV, skin temperature and respiration against your own 28-day baseline. On-device and approximate — informational only, not a diagnosis."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vigila tu FC en reposo, HRV, temperatura de la piel y respiración contra tu propia base de 28 días. En el dispositivo y aproximado, solo informativo, no un diagnóstico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We average your heart rate in 5-minute buckets across the day, from midnight. Your resting heart rate — the low while you sleep — is its own metric. The zones split the day by how hard your heart worked, as a percentage of your estimated maximum heart rate (zone 1 is 50–60%, zone 5 is 90–100%).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We average your heart rate in 5-minute buckets across the day, from midnight. Your resting heart rate — the low while you sleep — is its own metric. The zones split the day by how hard your heart worked, as a percentage of your estimated maximum heart rate (zone 1 is 50–60%, zone 5 is 90–100%)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Promediamos tu frecuencia cardiaca en tramos de 5 minutos a lo largo del día, desde medianoche. Tu frecuencia en reposo, la más baja mientras duermes, es una métrica aparte. Las zonas dividen el día según qué tan fuerte trabajó tu corazón, como porcentaje de tu frecuencia cardiaca máxima estimada (la zona 1 es 50–60%, la zona 5 es 90–100%)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We line up this vital against your own sleep and the prior day's strain, night by night across your history, and read which way it leans (Pearson correlation). We only show a direction once there are enough paired nights (about six weeks) and the link is strong enough to be unlikely to be chance — never the number, and never as a cause. (Plews 2013)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We line up this vital against your own sleep and the prior day's strain, night by night across your history, and read which way it leans (Pearson correlation). We only show a direction once there are enough paired nights (about six weeks) and the link is strong enough to be unlikely to be chance — never the number, and never as a cause. (Plews 2013)"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alineamos este vital con tu propio sueño y con el esfuerzo del día anterior, noche por noche a lo largo de tu historial, y leemos hacia dónde se inclina (correlación de Pearson). Solo mostramos una dirección cuando hay suficientes noches pareadas (unas seis semanas) y la relación es lo bastante fuerte como para que sea poco probable que sea azar, nunca el número, y nunca como causa. (Plews 2013)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wear it snug — the sensor needs skin contact.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wear it snug — the sensor needs skin contact."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Póntela ajustada, el sensor necesita contacto con la piel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Worked out without HRV or resting heart rate — the two heaviest signals. The number still holds, with less precision.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Worked out without HRV or resting heart rate — the two heaviest signals. The number still holds, with less precision."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Calculada sin HRV ni FC en reposo, las dos señales de mayor peso. El número sigue valiendo, con menos precisión."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Worked out without HRV — one of the heaviest signals. The number still holds, with less precision.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Worked out without HRV — one of the heaviest signals. The number still holds, with less precision."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Calculada sin HRV, una de las señales de mayor peso. El número sigue valiendo, con menos precisión."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Worked out without resting heart rate — one of the heaviest signals. The number still holds, with less precision.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Worked out without resting heart rate — one of the heaviest signals. The number still holds, with less precision."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Calculada sin FC en reposo, una de las señales de mayor peso. El número sigue valiendo, con menos precisión."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wrist optical sensors are less accurate than medical pulse oximeters — read this as a trend, not a clinical measurement. NOOP is not a medical device.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wrist optical sensors are less accurate than medical pulse oximeters — read this as a trend, not a clinical measurement. NOOP is not a medical device."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los sensores ópticos de muñeca son menos precisos que un oxímetro médico, léelo como tendencia, no como una medición clínica. NOOP no es un dispositivo médico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You don't have to wait — an experiment speeds up what I learn about you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No tienes que esperar, un experimento acelera lo que aprendo de ti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're sitting around your typical autonomic baseline — moderate stress, a normal, balanced day.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You're sitting around your typical autonomic baseline — moderate stress, a normal, balanced day."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estás alrededor de tu línea base autonómica típica, estrés moderado, un día normal y equilibrado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Apple Watch estimates VO₂max during outdoor walks and runs with a good GPS signal — it isn't recorded by the WHOOP strap.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your Apple Watch estimates VO₂max during outdoor walks and runs with a good GPS signal — it isn't recorded by the WHOOP strap."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu Apple Watch estima el VO₂max en caminatas y carreras al aire libre con buena señal de GPS, la banda WHOOP no lo registra."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Apple Watch estimates VO₂max from your heart rate and pace during brisk outdoor walks and runs with a good GPS signal, so it updates every so often rather than daily. We read where it sits among healthy adults of your age and sex (the FRIEND reference median), and translate that into a plain band. A higher VO₂max is associated with a lower risk of all-cause mortality — it's one of the best-evidenced markers of long-term health.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your Apple Watch estimates VO₂max from your heart rate and pace during brisk outdoor walks and runs with a good GPS signal, so it updates every so often rather than daily. We read where it sits among healthy adults of your age and sex (the FRIEND reference median), and translate that into a plain band. A higher VO₂max is associated with a lower risk of all-cause mortality — it's one of the best-evidenced markers of long-term health."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu Apple Watch estima el VO₂max a partir de tu frecuencia cardiaca y tu ritmo en caminatas y carreras al aire libre con buena señal de GPS, así que se actualiza de vez en cuando, no a diario. Leemos dónde cae entre adultos sanos de tu edad y sexo (la mediana de referencia FRIEND) y lo traducimos en una banda sencilla. Un VO₂max más alto se asocia con menor riesgo de mortalidad por todas las causas, es uno de los marcadores de salud a largo plazo mejor fundamentados."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your autonomic load today, from 0 to 3. We estimate it by comparing today's resting heart rate and HRV with your own 30-day baseline: a higher-than-usual resting HR and a lower-than-usual HRV both push the number up — classic signs your body is activated.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your autonomic load today, from 0 to 3. We estimate it by comparing today's resting heart rate and HRV with your own 30-day baseline: a higher-than-usual resting HR and a lower-than-usual HRV both push the number up — classic signs your body is activated."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu carga autonómica de hoy, del 0 al 3. La estimamos comparando tu frecuencia cardíaca en reposo y tu HRV con tu propia línea base de 30 días: una FC en reposo más alta de lo normal y una HRV más baja empujan el número hacia arriba, señales clásicas de que tu cuerpo está activado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your data is always stored the same way — this only changes how distances, weights, heights and temperatures are shown.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your data is always stored the same way — this only changes how distances, weights, heights and temperatures are shown."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tus datos siempre se guardan igual; esto solo cambia cómo se muestran distancias, pesos, estaturas y temperaturas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your heart rate across the day, in 5-minute averages. Your resting heart rate — the low while you sleep — is its own metric.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your heart rate across the day, in 5-minute averages. Your resting heart rate — the low while you sleep — is its own metric."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu frecuencia cardiaca a lo largo del día, en promedios de 5 minutos. Tu frecuencia en reposo, la más baja mientras duermes, es una métrica aparte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your heart rate when your body is fully at rest — how hard your heart has to work doing nothing. Lower generally means a stronger, more efficient cardiovascular system. Cénit uses it as ~20% of your recovery score; a rise from your norm can signal fatigue or that something's coming on.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your heart rate when your body is fully at rest — how hard your heart has to work doing nothing. Lower generally means a stronger, more efficient cardiovascular system. Cénit uses it as ~20% of your recovery score; a rise from your norm can signal fatigue or that something's coming on."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu frecuencia cardíaca cuando tu cuerpo está en reposo total: lo que le cuesta latir sin hacer nada. Más baja suele indicar un sistema cardiovascular más fuerte y eficiente. Cénit la usa como cerca del 20% de tu recuperación; una subida respecto a tu norma puede señalar fatiga o que algo se está gestando."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your levels come from your own baseline — a few more nights and they'll appear.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your levels come from your own baseline — a few more nights and they'll appear."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tus niveles salen de tu propia base, con unas noches más aparecen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your mid-sleep point is among your steadiest — it predicts your health better than total hours.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your mid-sleep point is among your steadiest — it predicts your health better than total hours."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu punto medio de sueño es de los más constantes, predice tu salud mejor que el total de horas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your mid-sleep point still shifts night to night — it predicts your health better than total hours.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your mid-sleep point still shifts night to night — it predicts your health better than total hours."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu punto medio de sueño aún cambia de una noche a otra, predice tu salud mejor que el total de horas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your night moves through four phases. The watch estimates them from your movement and heart rate, so they're approximate — it gets about 2 of 3 right.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your night moves through four phases. The watch estimates them from your movement and heart rate, so they're approximate — it gets about 2 of 3 right."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu noche pasa por cuatro fases. El reloj las estima con tu movimiento y tu ritmo cardiaco, así que son aproximadas: acierta cerca de 2 de cada 3."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your recovery is low — rest or train light today.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your recovery is low — rest or train light today."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu recuperación está baja: descansa o entrena suave hoy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your recovery sums up how ready your body is today, from 0 to 100. It blends several signals from your night — your HRV above all — and compares them with your own average from recent weeks, not anyone else's.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your recovery sums up how ready your body is today, from 0 to 100. It blends several signals from your night — your HRV above all — and compares them with your own average from recent weeks, not anyone else's."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu recuperación resume qué tan listo está tu cuerpo hoy, del 0 al 100. Combina varias señales de tu noche, sobre todo tu HRV, y las compara con tu propio promedio de las últimas semanas, no con el de nadie más."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your routines are created on your iPhone. NOOP never connects — you run the AI step yourself.": {
